2 CONT '''1482:''' Nevnt i valgbrevet for Kong Hans.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1483:''' Norges Riksråd, tilstede ved forhandlingene i Halmstad.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1499:''' Nevnt som avdød.
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilder: NST.1, s.139, f,343. DAA.10, 148 f og 16 s. 229. DN.16, 243 osv.
2 CONT
2 CONT I NST.1, s.139-141.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Svein Galle, er betre kjend. I avskrift frå 17de hundreåret finst det eit brev frå 1470 av lensmannen på Ringerike um bytet millom Hadeland og Romerike, efterdi som velborne mann Sven Galle, høvedsmann oppå Akershus, hadde a meg 
2 CONC befalet" (DN XVI, 243.) Hans setegård Åbygård, ser også ut til å være Kane gods, alstå var han ikke født der, som tidligere oppgitt på profilen.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Svend Galde''', til Aabygaard i [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohusl%C3%A4n Bahus] len
2 CONT
2 CONT He was knighted ([http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ridder Ridder]) in 1471 and made [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rigsraadet Norsk Rigsraad] (Norwegian Councillor of the Realm). A 17th century manuscript describes a letter dated 1470 
2 CONC from the sheriff in [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ringerike Ringerike] about switching between [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hadeland Hadeland] and [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romerike Romerike], "efteri som velbornmann Sven Gal
2 CONC le, høvedsmann oppå Akershus, hadde meg befalet" He was captain of [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akershus_Fortress Akershus Fortress] from 29 Jul 1472 and is mentioned in various letters on the national council. Stockholm 7 Aug 14
2 CONC 71 with the "peace letter" between the king and the Swedes, where he is listed last among the Norwegian and Danish knights. In 1482 in [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kristiania Christiania] during the union negotiations between [ht
2 CONC tp://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Norway Norway] and [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sweden Sweden], and all the State Council after [http://www.geni.com/people/Christian-I-of-Denmark/4103872 King Kristian I's] death, when it pledged its c
2 CONC laims to the new king and council with the Swedes, so also in the selection letter for the [http://www.geni.com/people/Kong-Hans-af-Danmark-Norge-och-Sverige/4104041 King Hans] in Halmstad 1 Feb 1482. In January 1483 he was presen
2 CONC t at the [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kalmar_Union Kalmar Union] accession negotiations in [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halmstad Halmstad]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Lady [http://www.geni.com/people/Kristine-Kane/6000000004257815704 Kristine Gautesdatter Kane]. Svend was also the feudal lord of Åby and had his manor house at Aabygaard which is located in present day [http://g
2 CONC .co/maps/he53k Åby Tossene, Sotenäs, Sweden]. His family were the founders of [http://www.panoramio.com/photo/4316432 Tossene kyrka].
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Children===
2 CONT
2 CONT *[http://www.geni.com/people/Oluf-Galde/6000000001652920058 Oluf Svensson Galde]
2 CONT *[http://www.geni.com/people/Gaute-Galde/6000000005086372603 Gaute Sveinssønn Galde]
2 CONT
