1 NAME Kettil Ragvaldson /Puke/
2 GIVN Kettil Ragvaldson
2 SURN Puke
2 _MARNM Puke
1 NAME Kettil Ragvaldsson //
2 GIVN Kettil Ragvaldsson
2 SURN Puke
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Alvastra kloster
2 ADDR
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1284
2 ADDR
3 STAE Östergötland County
3 CTRY Sweden
