2 CONT
2 CONT J'''ohann Schulte von Ennest''', 1585 - 1650
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann Schulte von Ennest was born in 1585, at birth place, to J'''ohann Schulte zu Ennest and Johanna Anna Elisabeth Schulte zu Ennest (born von Stockhausen).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Johann was born circa 1555, in Enste, Meschede, Hochsauerlandkreis, Arnsberg, Nordrhein-Westfalen, Germany. '''Johanna was born circa 1560''', in Stockhausen bei Meschede. Johann had 5 siblings: Steffen Schulte von Ennest, Jost Sc
2 CONC hulte zu Ennest and 3 other siblings. Johann married '''Elisabeth Schulte zu Ennest (born Von Der Hardt)''' on month day 1618, at age 33 at marriage place. Elisabeth was born on January 15 1592, in Welschen-Ennest, , Nordrhein-Wes
2 CONC tfalen, Germany. They had 3 children: Ludwig Schulte zu Ennest and 2 other children. Johann married first name Schulte zu Ennest (born Kreiggen). Johann passed away on month day 1650, at age 65 at death place.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT .
