2 CONC ieter, b7c6 and 4 others  Brother of Jan Harmensz Potgieter, b1; Frederik Potgieter, b2; Catharina Hermanszdocther Potgieter, b3 SM; Elisabeth Potgieter, b4; Amerentia Potgieter, b5; Maria Potgieter, b6 and Beatrix Hermanszdochter
