1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ⚠️ '''WARNING: Mixed and Unreliable Profile'''
2 CONT This profile is the result of conflating at least two different historical individuals from the 14th century and relies on outdated genealogical theories from the early 1900s.
2 CONT
2 CONT 🧩 '''Key Contradictions''':
2 CONT * '''Conflated Identities''': Historical records mention both a priest named Eyvind Olavsson and an Eyvind Tjostolfsson associated with the Kusse family. On Geni, they have been artificially combined into a single person.
2 CONT * '''Vow of Celibacy''': The profile states that Eyvind was a canon in Oslo and a priest in Bohuslän. Catholic clergy of that era could not have a legal wife (allegedly Anna Ranesdatter) and legitimate children who inherited noble
2 CONC  estates.
2 CONT * '''Outdated Sources''': The profile notes refer to publications from 1905. Modern Norwegian medieval historians in the ''NST (Norsk Slektshistorisk Tidsskrift)'' have long debunked this specific construction of the Bolt family t
2 CONC ree.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Nevnt med farsnavn Olavsson og Tjostolfsson. (Faren er derfor noe usikkert..)
2 CONT
2 CONT Eyvind Olavsson er nevnt på Jored.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eyvind Tjostolfsson er av Kusse-ætt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hvem av de er gift med en datter av Rane?  Og hvem er far til barna?
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://docs.google.com/viewer?a=v&q=cache:QeLw6oHxiCEJ:wangensteen.net/Bibliotek/Haavardsstad.pdf+Sira+Eyvind+Tjostolfsson&hl=no&pid=bl&srcid=ADGEESjyJSLxWeYFGwF6DVTZTAXauECHcTOHbJqwEvqVQxJzjtQWUhKncvbnuQEC3-QjLBhcn5r0wcfQ5FwtxTh
2 CONC S-6hBflablkUyj5nE2_0re9OoHiAaNoZXEGe_nUsYUvyZGmdH_iQe&sig=AHIEtbQjpx6Fw91tJbXQsR9VPg6ppkzW2A
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT linjen ser ut til å kunne følges her; 
2 CONT https://www.nb.no/items/e512313b35e359516ab4d1f987ca7fc8?page=360 
2 CONT Men dette - fra 1905 - bør sjekkes mot nyere kilder f.eks.;
2 CONT Bolt - NST 07/1-4 / 08-1
2 CONT Holck - NST 14-1+4
