2 CONT * '''Older trees claim Ragvald Puke was married to Anna Markvardsdotter Görtz. This is completely false. Primary parchment records show that Anna Görtz was actually the wife of his grandson (who was also named Ragvald Puke). This 
2 CONC profile firmly connects Ragvald Erengislesson Puke to his true wife from the Stjärnbjälke family.'''
2 CONT
