1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Currently  no valid sources for her as child of Johannes Potgieter  or even that she existed. 
2 CONT Not listed 1714 as surviving  child of  Clara Herbst
2 CONT Please add any should you discover them .
2 CONT
2 CONT Booysen website: http://www.booysen.org/phpgedview/individual.php?pid=I0161&ged=booysen.ged&tab=0
2 CONT
2 CONT There is doubt about the parents of ALETTA HARMENS, who married DIRK BOOYSEN of Drakenstein ‎(2nd son of Boy Booysen, the progenitor of the Booysen family in South Africa)‎ on 8 Feb. 1733 ‎(Cape)‎ - family listed in De Villiers Pa
2 CONC  ma, vol. 1, p. 68, sub b2. Dr J.A. Heese was of the opinion that she was a daughter of JAN ‎(Johannes)‎ HARMENSZ POTGIETER ‎(1674-?)‎. If this is true then was Aletta a daughter of Potgieter's first wife CLARA HERBST ‎(married 17
2 CONC 12)‎, or of his second wife MARIA CATHARINE VAN EEDEN ‎(married 1714)‎? Heese apparently favoured the latter. Aletta did have a daughter called Maria and two of her children married van Eedens. http://www.booysen.org/phpgedview/in
2 CONC dividual.php?pid=I0161&ged=booysen.ged&tab=0
2 CONT ------
2 CONT Marriage to Dirk Booijsz was Aletta Harmenz who came from Lubeck
2 CONT
2 CONT NGK Drakenstein
2 CONT
2 CONT >Ao 1733. Den 8 Febr. Dirk Booijsz van Cabo Burger aan Drakensteijn met Aletta Harmenz van Cabo. J.D.
2 CONT
2 CONT - Drakenstein I Marriages., CD-ROM (Paarl) Drakenstein Heemkring, 2006 , Marriage Register on http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/
2 CONT -----------
2 CONT http://www.geni.com/threads/6000000018058500184?page=2
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geni.com/discussions/114126
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geni.com/discussions/116537?msg=840819
2 CONT ------
2 CONT SAF vol 14 p 198 : Aletta (b8) {tov Hans Harms} in De Villiers/Pama, is d.v. Jan Harmsz POTGIETER. Sy x Paarl 8.2.1733 Dirk BOOYSEN)
2 CONT ------
2 CONT SAF vol 3
2 CONT
2 CONT b2 Dirk, burger Drakenstein x 8.2.1733 Aletta HARMENS, v. onbekende afkoms
