1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''She is assumed to be the daughter of Willem TEERLING and Lijsbeth SANDERS, with Johann HERBST being her stepfather.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Contribution from [http://www.geni.com/people/Delia-Robertson/6000000004029098351 '''Delia Robertson'''] on 29th Oct 2014. '''See The First Fifty Years Project entry for Clara Herfst''' at  : http://e-family.co.za/ffy/g6/p6198.htm
2 CONC . See the website for details on father and stepfather.
2 CONT
2 CONT Clara Herfst
2 CONT F, #6198, b. circa September 1689, d. before 18 February 1714
2 CONT Father-Putative*	Willem Teerling b. c 1633; putative relationship1,2
2 CONT Mother*	Lijsbeth Sanders1,2 b. b 2 Mar 1659, d. c 1743
2 CONT Step-father	Jan Herfst b. c 1660; de facto step or adoptive relationship1
2 CONT Charts	Descendants of Lijsbeth Sanders
2 CONT Copyright / Terms of Use Notice
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The material on this website is subject to copyright.
2 CONT Facts (names, dates, and places) are not copyright. You are free to transcribe them but not cut and paste into your data provided you use the correct attribution and citation.
2 CONT I have created the narratives, sentences, and citations; they are copyright and may not be used.
2 CONT You may not add them to your genealogy, your personal documents, your tree on Ancestry, nor in the data or profile sections on Geni, nor anywhere else.
2 CONT Many of the images are also copyright. You may not copy them without the consent of the copyright holders.
2 CONT You must use the correct attribution and citation, viz.: Robertson, Delia. The First Fifty Years Project. Here you add the page URL.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited	25/10/2014
2 CONT Birth*	Clara Herfst was born circa September 1689 in de Caep de Goede Hoop.1,2
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage*	She married Johannes Potgieter, son of Harmen Jansz Potgieter and Isabella Frederiksz, on 24 July 1712 Nederduitsch Gereformeerde Kerk, Stellenbosch, de Caep de Goede Hoop.3,4,5
2 CONT
2 CONT Death*	She died before 18 February 1714 de Caep de Goede Hoop.6,2
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT Johannes Potgieter b. 23 Sep 1674, d. 1733
2 CONT Children	
2 CONT Johanna Potgieter10 b. b 3 May 1707
2 CONT Elisabeth Potgieter+11 b. b 31 Mar 1709
2 CONT Sibille Potgieter+12 b. b 28 Jun 1711
2 CONT Names in the record, in publications, etc.	An unknown date , the name of Clara was written in the record as Clara Herbst.
2 CONT 3 May 1707, the name of Clara was written in the record as Clara Harst.7
2 CONT Baptisms - Witness	Clara Herfst and Hans Jurgen Potgieter witnessed the baptism of Jannetie Potje on 11 December 1712 Nederduitsch Gereformeerde Kerk, Stellenbosch, de Caep de Goede Hoop.8 See: Baptism of Jannetie Potje
2 CONT
