2 CONC ear), the following record is dated 7 September 1789.
2 CONT >>''...Dit is syn de goederen van den overledene mejuffrouw Isabilla Potgieter weduwe wylen Philip du Preez...''
2 CONT * MOOC 10 - Auctions - MOOC10/15.93 (volume 15 number 93) lists auction of estate/inventory of IZABELLA POTGIETER the spouse of PHILIP DU PREÊ. This is an undated entry but is in volume 15 of MOOC 10 which lists entries from 1786 
2 CONC - 1790. It sits between an entry dated 29 Sep 1789 and 28 April 1790.
2 CONT * MOOC 13 - Estate Liquidation and Distributions - MOOC13/1.16 (volume 1 number 16) indexed on NAAIRS and dated 1789. [http://www.national.archsrch.gov.za/sm300cv/smws/sm300dl ''DEPOT KAB, SOURCE MOOC, TYPE LEER, VOLUME_NO 13/1/16
