1 NOTE Magdalena married Petrus (Pieter) De Wet on 16 Mar 1747/1748 in Cape,South Africa. Petrus died on 30 Jan 1782 in Drakenstein,Cape,South Africa.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT     + 	58 	F 	i 	Helena Josina De Wet died .
