2 CONT     + 	60 	M 	iii 	Pieter De Wet died .
2 CONT     + 	61 	F 	iv 	Susanna Johanna De Wet died .
2 CONT     + 	62 	F 	v 	Maria Magdalena De Wet died .
2 CONT       	63 	F 	vi 	Hester De Wet died in Cape,South Africa.
2 CONT     + 	64 	M 	vii 	Hendrik Christoffel De Wet died .
2 CONT     + 	65 	F 	viii 	Anna Catharina De Wet died .
2 CONT     + 	66 	F 	ix 	Johanna Francina De Wet died on 12 Aug 1847.
2 CONT     + 	67 	M 	x 	Johannes Marthinus De Wet was born on 2 Oct 1757. He died on 27 Mar 1807. 
