2 CONT *  In the interim, whilst waiting for the improved data field layout Geni is working on, I am adding all married names in the last name field, listing them in order of the marriages.  I am doing this on profiles which I am coming 
2 CONC across in the normal run of my work on Geni - I am not actively searching these circumstances out.
2 CONT
2 CONT I have removed Jacob Kruger SV/PROG and  Isaac van Ess as husbands of Cornelia Botha b7.   I can find no reference to her being married to these men. If there is such evidence I would be happy to learn about it and see sources sup
2 CONC porting the information.  CJB
2 CONT
