2 CONC nnes Potgieter, b7c8d8; Emmerentia Frederika Kotzè, c8d9; Frederik Potgieter, b7c8d10; Hester Potgieter; <private> Potgieter and Elsie Potgieter « less 
2 CONT  Brother of Hermanus Potgieter b7c1; Martha Potgieter, b7c2; Elsie Snyman; Isabella Lessing Potgieter, b7c4; Catharina Potgieter, b7c6; Amarentia Potgieter b7c5; Maria Potgieter, b7c7 and Hans Jurgen Potgieter, b7c9 « less 
