2 CONT >>>>>>>>* (a)       '''HAAKON Finsson''' m ---.  The name of Haakon´s wife is not known.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Haakon & his wife had one child'''
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>>>>>>>* (1)       '''ULVHILD Haakonsdatter''' (-before 1143).  Fagrskinna names “Úlfhildr dróttning, dóttir Hákonar Finnssunar Hárekssunar or Þjóttu” as mother of “Karl konungs”, adding that she had first married “Nikolás Dana
2 CONC konungr”, secondly “Ingi Sviakonungr Hallsteinssunr” and thirdly “Sverkir konungr Kolssunr”[68].  Her second marriage is referred to by Saxo Grammaticus.  She was secretly abducted by Sverker I King of Sweden but their "connection
2 CONC  was accepted as a marriage"[69].  '''married firstly as his second wife, INGE II Halstensson King of Sweden, son of HALSTEN Stenkilsson King of Sweden & his wife''' --- (-1118).  '''married secondly (divorced) as his second wife,
2 CONC  NIELS King of Denmark, illegitimate son of SVEND II King of Denmark & his mistress --- (-murdered Schleswig 25 Jun 1134).''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT >>>>>>* iii)        '''SVEN Harkesson'''
2 CONT * 2.         '''NJAL Finsson''' m ---.  The name of Njal´s wife is not known.  
