1 NAME Heidenreich II. /von Plettenberg/
2 GIVN Heidenreich II.
2 _MARNM von Plettenberg
2 NICK Herman
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1222
1 DEAT
2 DATE AFT 1312
1 OCCU Ritter, urkl. 1256-74, 1266/67 Marshal of Westphalia
1 TITL Ritter
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1258, 1286, Ritter, Dapifer d. Grafen v. Arnsberg, 1266-68 Marshall
2 CONT
2 CONT Events:
2 CONT
2 CONT • Events: Beurkundet, 1258-1274.
2 CONT
2 CONT • Events: Marschall von Westfalen, 1266-1268.
2 CONT
2 CONT • Fact: Dapifer der Grafen von Arnsberg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Heidenreich married Lucia Or Sophia NN circa 1260. (Lucia Or Sophia NN was born circa 1240 in Plettenberg, NW, DEU and died after 1295.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Heidenreich (Heydenricus) von Plettenberg was Drost of the Counts of Arnsberg''' in 1258 and '''Marshal of''' '''Westphalia''' in 1266. His brothers (or cousins) Otto and Rudolf von Plettenberg were canons of Essen Abbey in 128
2 CONC 6.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Johann I von Plettenberg''' (* before 1270, † after 1314), son of '''Heidenreich and his wife Lucia, was Marshal of Westphalia''' from 1294 to 1298 and from 1300 to 1312. In 1231, Rabodo von Plettenberg was the main donor of th
2 CONC e Dominican monastery in Soest .''' Other marshals of Westphalia were Hunold I''' (1256-60 and 1267), Hunold II (1303) and Hermann (1352).
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
