1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Surname alternates: Tarling / Teerling
2 CONT
2 CONT Reference [http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/g13/p13525.htm The First Fifty Years Project]
2 CONT
2 CONT ''J.L. (Leon) Hattingh, "Die Blanke Nageslag van Louis van Bengale en Lijsbeth van die Kaap", Kronos (Die Blanke nageslag . . .) 1 (1979):''
2 CONT
2 CONT > Of dit in die eerste plek Louis se optrede teenoor haar was, óf bloot daaruit voortgespruit het, is nie duidelik nie, maar Lijsbeth het 'n verhouding met die 56 jarige Willem Teerling gehad. Teerling wat in Engeland gebore is en
2 CONC  'n aantal jare in die Kompanjiesdiens was voordat hy 'n vryburger geword het, was vir 'n tyd lank die kneg en skaapwagter van Louis van Bengale. Hattingh cites court documents of 1689 in which Teerling is said to be 56 years old.
2 CONC . Hereinafter cited as "Die Blanke nageslag."
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Mentioned in the [https://www.eggsa.org/sarecords/index.php/muster-rolls/cape-archives-vc-copies/17-cape-muster-roll-1686 1686 Cape muster roll] as Willem Teerlinck.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned in the [https://www.eggsa.org/sarecords/index.php/muster-rolls/cape-archives-vc-copies/342-cape-muster-roll-1690-free-men 1690 Cape muster roll] as Willem Teerlingh.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned in the [https://www.eggsa.org/sarecords/index.php/muster-rolls/cape-archives-vc-copies/343-cape-muster-roll-1691-free-men 1691 Cape muster roll] as Willem Teerling.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned in the [https://www.eggsa.org/sarecords/index.php/muster-rolls/cape-archives-vc-copies/366-cape-muster-roll-1692 1692 Cape muster roll] as Willem Teerlink.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mentioned in the [https://www.eggsa.org/sarecords/index.php/muster-rolls/cape-archives-vc-copies/372-cape-muster-roll-1698 1698 Cape muster roll] as Willem Teerlink.
