2 NICK Maria van Dalen
2 NICK Maria Rousseau
2 NICK Maria Rossar
2 NICK Marÿ Russaar
1 SEX F
1 BAPM
2 DATE 19 OCT 1666
2 ADDR
3 CITY Blois
3 STAE Centre
3 CTRY France
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 19 OCT 1666
2 ADDR
3 CITY Blois
3 STAE Centre-Val de Loire
3 POST 41000
