1 NAME Jan Jansz /van Eeden/
2 GIVN Jan Jansz
2 SURN van Eeden
2 _MARNM van Eeden
2 NICK Jan van Oldenburg
2 NICK Jan Jansz van Eden
2 NICK Sopie
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 1637
2 ADDR
3 CITY Oldenburg
3 CTRY Germany
1 BAPM
2 DATE 27 MAY 1638
2 ADDR
3 CITY Utrecht
3 STAE Utrecht
3 CTRY Netherlands
