1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Baptism Notice of Christoffel Botha===
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HY-6LWP-6H?i=54&cc=1478678
2 CONT
2 CONT *Christoffel Bota	
2 CONT *Baptism	11 Feb 1713	
2 CONT *Stellenbosch, Cape of Good Hope, South Africa							
2 CONT *Teunis Bota	
2 CONT *Maria Snymans		
2 CONT
2 CONT Note - Christoffel was married twice first to Hester
2 CONT
2 CONT Potgieter in 1733 and she died in 1735.  After a decent interval
2 CONT
2 CONT Chistoffel got married again on the 10th of November 1737 to Catharina
2 CONT
2 CONT Blom and he wasted no time in getting his new wife pregnant. [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HT-6LX3-JMF?i=13&cc=1478678&personaUrl=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3AVFTM-R49] and[ https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/
2 CONC 3:1:3Q9M-CSKD-WSMR-4?cc=2821281&personaUrl=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3ACLGV-MJW2]
2 CONT
2 CONT So, it is really only Theunis b1c2d1 -- christened on 18 July 1734 -- and Maria
2 CONT
2 CONT Magdelana b1c2d2 -- christened on 5 Feb 1736 -- that arose from the
2 CONT
2 CONT first marriage.  And Catharian Botha  -- who was christened on 13 Oct
2 CONT
2 CONT 1749 -- most certainly had Catharina Blom as her mother and not Hester
2 CONT
2 CONT Potgieter.
2 CONT
2 CONT As brought to our notice by Edward (Ted) Reinier Swart b2c2d2
2 CONT
2 CONT SAG Volume 1 has omitted this bit of vital information
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Inventories of the Orphan Chamber Cape Town Archives Repository, South Africa===
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://databases.tanap.net/mooc/make_pdf.cfm?output=pdf&id=MOOC8/10.66a MOOC8/10.66a]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Catharina Blom - Christoffel Botha'''
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 Januarij 1764
2 CONT
2 CONT Inventaris mitsg:s taxatie van alle sodanige goederen, als ab intestato metter dood zijn ontruijmt ende
2 CONT naargelaaten door Catharina Blom, ten voordeele van haaren naargelatene man Christoffel Botha ter eenree,
2 CONT mitsgaders haare bij eevengem:e haaren man in huwelijk verwekte neegen kinderen, met naamen
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) Pieter Barendsz:e Botha oud 21 jaaren
2 CONT 2) Jacobus Botha oud 19 jaaren
2 CONT 3) Philippus Rudolphus Botha oud 15 jaaren
2 CONT 4) Maria Catharina Botha oud 14 jaaren
2 CONT 5) Theunis Christoffel Botha oud 12 jaaren
2 CONT 6) Margaretha Lowisa Botha oud 9 jaaren
2 CONT 7) Susanna Elisabeth Botha oud 7 jaaren
2 CONT 8) Agatha Botha oud 4 jaaren
2 CONT 9) Johanna Christina Botha oud 3 jaaren
2 CONT
2 CONT sodanige ende indiervoegen, als deselven door de landbouwers David Fori en Philip du Plessies zijn
2 CONT opgenoomen en ginventariseert, mitsg:rs bij d ondergeteekende gecommitt:e Weesmeesteren getaxeert in
2 CONT maniere als volgt, te weeten
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT =Christoffel Botha=
2 CONT is a child of [http://www.geni.com/people/Theunis-Botha/6000000005788458301?through=6000000001580940776 Theunis Botha], b bef 15 April 1686. Called Botha after his mother, [http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Kickers/4705796237050024
2 CONC 653?through=6000000005788458301 Maria Kickers]' , 1700 divorce from [http://www.geni.com/people/Jan-Cornelisz/4141861275630023780?through=4705796237050024653 Jan Cornelisz] (who is shown as his father on the birth certificate). At
2 CONC  which time  she said her 7 children were [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-Botha-SV-PROG/5356428241620125193?through=4705796237050024653 Frederich Botha]'s.
2 CONT However, a recent DNA  [http://repository.up.ac.za/bitstream/handle/2263/32007/Greeff_Appel(2013).pdf?sequence=1 study  by  the University of Pretoria]  reveal him to have been the biological son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Fer
2 CONC dinandus-Appel-b2/6000000001580940776?through=6000000005788458301 Ferdinandus Appel].'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * DeVilliers Pama Botha b1c2
2 CONT * DeVilliers Pama Appel b2c1d2
2 CONT
