1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Her first child, https://www.geni.com/people/Lourens-Erasmus/6000000001980278902 was born out of wedlock. The presumptive father, with whom she had a known relationship, was https://www.geni.com/people/Lourens-Eras
2 CONC mus/6000000001418432745?through=6000000001980278902
2 CONT ----
2 CONT http://www.ballfamilyrecords.co.uk/gous/I166.html
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT The First Fifty Years Project http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/g5/p5229.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Hoffman
2 CONT
2 CONT b. before 1 May 1707, d. 1767
2 CONT
2 CONT Father*	Johannes Hoffman b. c 1678
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother*	Maria Louisz b. b 10 Feb 1686
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Hoffman was born before 1 May 1707
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Hoffman was baptized on 1 May 1707
2 CONT
2 CONT * '[1707] den 1. Meij Jan Hofman en Maria Lowies onder getuijgen van Jan Jùrijn Cotze meet Margreta Vissers. Catharina' NGK Kaapstad
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Circa 1728 Catharina Hoffman and Lourens Erasmus were lovers at de Caep de Goede Hoop. ''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Fredrik Huppener, son of Peter Hübner and Catharina Potgieter, on 31 March 1736 at Nederduitsch Gereformeerde Kerk, Drakenstein, de Caep de Goede Hoop.
2 CONT
2 CONT * 'Deze navolgende Personen machen hier nerens ingeboekt worden. Fredrik Huppener Jongman met Catharina Hofman van Cabo.'
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Frederick Scheepers, son of Coenraad Scheepers and Maria Botha, on 7 June 1739 at Nederduitsch Gereformeerde Kerk, Drakenstein, de Caep de Goede Hoop.
2 CONT
2 CONT * ' 7 Junij [1739]. Fredrik Scheepers van Cabo de Goede Hoop Burger aan Stellenbosch, J.M. en Cartharina Hoffman van Cabo voornd wede van Friderick Hibner.'
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Willem Landman on 10 March 1747 at Tulbagh
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1747, den 10 Maart of den 26 Maart Willem Landman van Amsterdam, jongman burger in de vergleege districten met Catharina Hofman van Cabo de goede Hoop, wedw. wijlen Fredrik Schepers 
2 CONT
2 CONT She and Pierre Pinard witnessed the baptism of Saara de Buijs on 7 December 1732 at Nederduitsch Gereformeerde Kerk, Drakenstein, de Caep de Goede Hoop.
2 CONT
2 CONT * '1732; item [den 7de 10br - December]; Saara; Jan de Buijs de Jonge en Elsie Hofmans; Pieter Pinaer ende Catharina Hofman.'
2 CONT
