2 CONC Duijvenhoxrivier died circa 1752 (date of inventory) xx [http://www.geni.com/people/Johannes-Vosloo/6000000001634162996?through=6000000001634228932 Jan Vosloo] 26 November 1752 Stellenbosch died circa 1756 (date of inventory) xxx 
2 CONC [http://www.geni.com/people/Johannes-Laas/6000000010410030621?through=6000000001634228932 Jan Lasch] 15 October 1769 Tulbagh.  She appears to have had children by all three husbands. 
