2 CONT >b6.c5 [http://www.geni.com/people/Sara-Gous/6000000000234137289 Sara Gous], born circa 1727 at the Cape, died circa 1797 x [http://www.geni.com/people/Nicolaas-de-Bruyn/6000000000269725818?through=6000000000234137289 Claas de Bru
2 CONC ijn] 9 March 1745 Tulbagh born at the Cape, died before 1797  They appear to have had no children. 
