2 CONT {geni:about_me} She and her husband are both witnesses at the birth of their grandchild, on 15 April 1787, which implies she deceased after that date.  [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HT-DRH9-1CL?i=9&cc=1478678 Bapt
2 CONC ism of Catharina Frederika Swanepoel]
