4 CONT The information about the date of birth of Douwe Gerbrands Steyn is incorrect. He was born in 1631, most probably in Bozum, Friesland. Douwe could not have been born in 1653 as is stated above. He was baptized in 1631, confirmed i
4 CONC n 1642, married his first wife in 1657 and his first son was baptized in 1661. All of these dates have been confirmed by documentation found in the Tresoar archives in Leeuwarden, Friesland, the Netherlands. 
