1 NOTE {geni:about_me} First name: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Her first name as spelt in early documents: Antie, Antje. She was most probably named after her grandmother, Antje/Antye Huigs. Her first name is recorded as Anna when she is a witness at the baptism of her grandson Douwe Gerbrand
2 CONC  Prins and when she married Martinus Prins
2 CONT
2 CONT Surname: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Antie's surname variants: STEYN / STEIJN. In the birth document of her son she is listed as Antje DOUWE.
2 CONT
2 CONT On Geni we tend to use the maiden surnames / birth name of all ladies born in South Africa up till 1806 when the Cape came under British influence and the ladies started to use the surname of their husbands once they were married.
2 CONC  This helps to avoid confusion especially if the lady in question was married two or three times. We add the tag after the maiden/birth surname e.g. Anna Steyn b2. If her married name is Prins, as is the case here, the b2 should n
2 CONC ot be put after Prins, because that would make people think she was b2 in the Prins family. So then one would indicate like this Anna Prins (Steyn b2).  It would be very helpful if everybody kept to this guideline. Thanks.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT More information about Antie Steijn can be found on the website of The First Fifty Years Project http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/g9/p9930.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Oudste register van die kerk.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Die peettante van Maria Lozee se dogter Anna was niemand anders as die eggenote van die bekende eerw. J. Overney, predikant van Kaapstad en stigter van die gemeente Stellenbosch, wat in 1687 oorlede is. Dit is byna seker dat hy J
2 CONC acobus gedoop het en die huwelike tussen Douwe Gerbrants en sy vrou volstrek het. As mens terug reken vanaf die doop van Jacobus in 1683, dan is die datum van die geboorte van Maria Lozee aan die Kaap ongeveer 1660-5."Alt Marriage
2 CONC : Maria LOZEE(LOOSEE) v.d.K. vdK Date: 9 Aug 1685 Location: South Africa
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.greeff.info/tng01/getperson.php?personID=I16883&tree=PedigrFAGreeffEsagi
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Stein-1503
