2 CONT '''Occupation & Career:''' Arrived in South Africa as a soldier in the service of the VOC on the ship Middelwoud. He later owned the farm “Nabygelegen”, Bovlei, Wellington. He was a member of the first Magistrate in Roodezand (tod
