2 CONT '''The date of his death has been inherited through various merges - does anyone have this date for certain and if possible a source? -WB
2 CONT '''
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT According to CC de Villiers - Geslagregister van Vroeë Kaapse families he was baptised on 2/11/1687 and married to Catharina Pyl 14/7/1709.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT His Family  x Catrina Pijl b. 16 Nov 1692
2 CONT '''Children''':	
2 CONT # Frederik Bota10 b. b 11 Aug 1709
2 CONT # Maria Catrina Bota+10 b. b 14 Dec 1710
2 CONT # Willem Bota11 b. b 7 Aug 1712, d. b 4 Jan 1728
