2 CONT # Cornelia Bota+10 b. b 10 Jan 1717, d. 9 Apr 1760
2 CONT # Anna Bota10 b. b 23 Oct 1718
2 CONT # Catrina Bota+10 b. b 25 Jan 1722
2 CONT # Martha Elizabeth Botha+12 b. b 15 Dec 1726
2 CONT # Willem Bootha1 b. b 4 Jan 1728
