0 @I6000000007834317988@ INDI
1 NAME Catrijna /Both/
2 GIVN Catrijna
2 SURN Both
2 NICK Catrijna Cornelisz
2 NICK Catrina Bota
2 NICK Katharina Bota
1 SEX F
1 BAPM
2 DATE 7 MAY 1690
2 ADDR
3 CITY Cape Town
3 STAE Caep de Goede Hoop
3 CTRY South Africa
1 BIRT
2 DATE BEF 7 MAY 1690
2 ADDR
