1 NOTE 27728425. Åsta GUDBRANDSDTR (6326) was born about 970. (6327) She was baptised about 998. (6328) She died about 1020. (6329) Hun ble besøkt av Olav den Hellige i 1015 og efter Sigurd Syrs død 1018.
