2 CONT     * Godwin family tree
2 CONT     * Cnut's family tree In popular culture
2 CONT
2 CONT Godwin has been portrayed by Torin Thatcher in the film Lady Godiva of Coventry (1955) and by Bill Wallis in an episode of the British educational TV series Historyonics entitled "1066" (2004). Lewis Collins is set to portray him 
2 CONC in upcoming movie 1066 (2011). Godwin is also the lead character of Justin Hill's novel, Shieldwall (2011).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT     * Mason, Emma. The House of Godwine: The History of Dynasty. Hambledon Press, 2003.
2 CONT     * Stenton, F.M. Anglo-Saxon England (Oxford History of England), 2001.
2 CONT     * Thorne, J.O. and Collocott, T.C. Chambers Biographical Dictionary, Revised Edition. (Edinburgh: Chambers, 1984) ISBN 0-550-16010-8
2 CONT     * Walker, Ian. Harold: The Last Anglo-Saxon King, 1997.
2 CONT
