1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Harold Godwinson (c. 1022 – 14 October 1066) also known as Harold II, was the last Anglo-Saxon King of England before the Norman Conquest.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married: Ealdgyth, Gryffydd's widow, they had one son Harold
