1 NOTE {geni:about_me} NN ingen Maíl Coluim mac Cináeda''' was the youngest daughter of Malcolm II. Her name is uncertain (Olith, Anleta, Thora, was she actually Donada?).
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents Malcolm II and his NN wife 
2 CONT * Spouse: Sigurd II Digri Orkneyjarl
2 CONT * Child: Thorfinn Sigurdsson Orkneyjarl
2 CONT
2 CONT ===NOTES===
2 CONT
2 CONT *It is highly unlikely that she is the same daughter who married Finley - see below. [Anne Berge]
2 CONT *It is perfectly possible that Sigurd took Donada from Findlaech in proximal territorial raids that were happening at the time, long before Findlaech died – Sharon Doubell] 
2 CONT
