2 CONT >>>c)         [http://www.geni.com/people/Arnfinn-Orkneyjarl/6000000001169221732?through=6000000000160866853  ARNFINN] Torfinnsson (-murdered Murkle, Caithness <nowiki>----</nowiki>).  
