1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Gunni Óláfsson''', perhaps the eponymous ancestor of Clan Gunn. He spent much of his life at Duncansby Head on the Scottish mainland in his father's home. About 1150, [https://www.geni.com/people/Haraldr-Maddads
2 CONC on-Earl-of-Caithness-Orkney/6000000003827855731 Jarl Harald] outlawed Gunni for having an illegitimate son with [https://www.geni.com/people/Margr%C3%A9t-H%C3%A1konard%C3%B3ttir-countess-of-Orkney/6000000001745051519 Margaret, Cou
2 CONC ntess of Atholl]. His brother [https://www.geni.com/people/Sweyn-Asleifson-the-Ultimate-Viking/6000000003828029462 Sweyn Asleifson] sent him south to Lewis to stay with a friend. What became of him is not known, but some sources s
2 CONC uggest that he eventually returned to Gairsay.
