2 CONT The third (1986) edition of the Royal Historical Society's Handbook ofBritish Chronology' says Olaf I was the son of Godred I (Croven) whoruled from 1079-95.  Godred was perhaps the son of Harald the Black ofYsland and has been co
2 CONC njectured to be the grandson of Godred son ofHarold  who was probably the ruler of Man in 979.
