2 CONC  the fourth Hersa of Gouldbrandsdall, married Ingrida, a daughter of Sir Steen Arnison of Storkrim, an eminent Knight, and progenitor of the noble family of Sparre in Denmark and Sweden ; the issue of this marriage was one daughte
