1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lillieh%C3%B6%C3%B6k_af_G%C3%A4lared_och_Kolb%C3%A4ck_nr_66
2 CONT
2 CONT Bertil was district judge and judge and lived in Kolbäck in Mountain Stena. to Kolbäck (Kolbäck Torp) in Borgstena Sn (P),  he seems to have acquired through the marriage.  The first full certainty felt ancestor  for the families 
2 CONC Lilliehöök.  Brought into force half a lily with a standing thereon  bird. Each judge in Bjärke district in 1462 and  still 9/11 1486 and in Kållands district in 1462 and even  8/4 1494th Called the "free-born man" 7/7 1467th Witn
2 CONC essing  one of his wife's nephew Harald Lakes wife's deed of gift  11/8 1474th Was present at the lawman thing in  Crowd 6/7 1484, when he was called "honest and välbördig man. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Bertil Pedersson Lilliehöök ~ Gunilla Torbjörnsdotter  til Kolbäck, Mountain Stena sogn, Johannesburg Plain (Gumsehuvud)  Nævnt as væbner on Kolbäck 1463 til Kolbäck, Mountain Stena Sogn, Alingsåsvägen  Herredshøvding Kålland 1462
2 CONC -1494  Herredshøvding Bjärke 1462-1486  Faldt in battle firewood Örkelljunga *, Skane  † 1510 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Bertil PEDERSSON LILLIEHÖÖK'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Circuit judge. Was at most 80 years.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Father:	 Peder MAGNUSSON LILLI HÖÖK (1390 -) ''' '''Mother:	 Bengta Pedersdotter Bonde (1394 -)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Born:	 1430 Kolbackstrup, Halland	
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:	 27-08-1510 Örkelljunga	 At the Battle of Örkelljunga
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marriage with Gunilla TORBJÖRN DAUGHTER GUMSEHUFVUD'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage:	 1463
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Brynte BERTILSSON (LILLI HÖÖK) (1460-1510)
2 CONT
2 CONT Erik BERTILSSON LILLI HÖÖK (- <1524)
2 CONT
2 CONT Peder BERTILSSON FARMER (LILLI HÖÖK) (- <1485)
2 CONT
2 CONT Birger BERTILSSON LILLIEHÖK (- (1510/1524))
2 CONT
