1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From Zutphen in Gelderland. The progenitor is shown in the baptismal and marriage registers as Pieter Christiaens. His wife, Hermina Karels is of unknown heritage and has no connection with the Carelse family(the p
2 CONC rogenitor of the Carelse family only arrived at the Cape by about 1740)
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=ahlersvlerouxh&id=I208937
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the First Fifty Years Project website, his first wife was Willemina van Mauritius (although the spelling was 'Ermina Karels' in the documentation about her marriage, it was 'Willemina van Mauritius' in the documentati
2 CONC on about her baptism), daughter of Iba van Timor. His second wife was Adriana Gerritsdogter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/g10/p10657.htm and http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/g10/p10001.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------
