1 NOTE {geni:about_me} a  Joost Strydom, born about 1655, immigrated to the Cape of Good Hope 1678, from Liefkenshoek, Netherlands, as an “adelbors” in the VOC, † abt 1719 (Kaapstad), x 1686 Maryna Ras, *1669 (Cape of Good Hope) † 1713 (
2 CONC Cape of Good Hope), 5 known children. She was a daughter of  Hans Ras and Catharina Ustincx; Joost xx 11.2.1714 Susanna Groen, *1655 (Delft) † 1718 (Cape of Good Hope), widow of Jacobus van der Steen, and also widow of  Johannes C
2 CONC ornelisz de Hoogh, daughter of Jacob Jacobsz Groen and Neeltje Jacobs van Dijck, of Delft.
2 CONT * b3  Matthys, =4.6.1690 (Kaapstad) † 1737 [See will MOOC 57/1737, 7/1/5], x 14.6.1711 Elizabeth (Isabeau) Nortje, *1690 † 1772 [see MOOC 24/1772, 13/1/8], dv Daniel Nortier & Maria Vitout, van Calais
2 CONT ** c3  Johannes, =4.4.1717 † 28.9.1759 (Agter Cogmanskloof), x (Kaapstad) 13.9.1744 Maria Nortje, =28.5.1724 † <1769,[sy xx 3.5.1765 Pieter Labuschagne, *1736], dv Jacob Nortier & Margaretha Mouton
2 CONT ** d5 Maria, =16.7.1752, [will filed 1794, MOOC 51/1791, 7/1/39], x 14.2.1768 Frederik de Jager, =31.1.1740, sv Andries Pieter de Jager & Elizabeth Potgieter
2 CONT
