2 CONT * Cape Civil Deaths - Riversdale, Cape Colony - Entry : 2007 - 2004 3/4 Filed 23 June 1853
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Isabella Hermina de Jager passed away on 17 May 1853 on the farm ' Nova ' Riversdale District. She was aged 63 years and 2 months , a farmers wife and widow of the late Casparus Bresler.
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Her parents were Christijan Jacobus de Jager and Jacoba Isabella du Preez
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Children : Jacoba Elizabeth, Johannes Augustus, Christiaan Jacobus, Frans Reinard and Pieter Benjamin -  all majors.
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Left property to the value of 3034 Ryksdollars according to her inventory
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * Signed : S.R.J. Theunissen
