2 CONT '''e6 Hester Isabella''' * c. 1779 ≈ Kaapstad 25.4.1779 † 27.8.1853 x 7.2.1796 Jacobus DU PLESSIS ≈ 3.9.1769 † “Corintherivier” 10.6.1851 s.v. Daniel du Plessis en Helena Aletta Olivier
2 CONT
2 CONT Cape Civil Deaths - Entry : 17 of 1853  Filed 17 September 1853  - Hester Isabella du Plessis ( nee van Wyk ) passed away on 27 August 1853 at the home of Johannes Lombard, Riversdale District. She was aged 74 years and 7 months a
2 CONC nd was a farmers wife, being the widow of the late Johannes du Plessis.
2 CONT
2 CONT She left about £10 sterling worth of movable property.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Notice signed by : Robert Frier - Son in Law of the deceased
