2 CONT :e1  Margaretha Jacoba = 5.10.1787 x J.J. FOURIE:e2  Johanna Catharina = 5.10.1787 x Swellendam 6.10.1805 Roelof Daniel VAN WYK
2 CONT :e3  Elizabeth Catharina = 27.10.1789 x Pieter CRONJE
2 CONT :e4  Pieter Christiaan = 5.6.1791 x Elizabeth CRONJE:f8  Johannes Gerhardus * 13.4.1830 = Swellendam 27.10.1830 x Sara Susanna CRONJE:e5  Maria Magdalena = Stellenbosch 29.7.1793 x Caledon 9.10.1814 Andries Petrus VAN WYK
2 CONT :e6  Catharina Carolina = 19.12.1794:e7  Johannes Gerhardus = Stellenbosch 9.10.1796 x Caledon 9.7.1815 Maria Susanna OLIVIER
