2 CONT Cape Civil Deaths - Entry : 7413  Filed 31 July 1844  - Adriaan Ludowicus van Wyk passed away on 20 July 1884 at his residence at Voorbaai, Groote Zwartberg Ward / Wyk, Swellendam District of the Cape Colony. He was aged 57 years 
2 CONC and a farmer married to Gesina Strydom. He left a farm, cattle, furniture and an estate above £ 6000 but under £ 50 000  - Death Notice signed by : J.F. van Wyk  - Son of the deceased
