2 CONC re it docked on 5 June 1688. Among thoseon board were Hercules des Prez, Cecilea d'Atis, Hercules des Prez, Elizabeth des Prez, Marie Jeanne des Prez and Philippe des Prez. Name Record: The name of Philippe des Prez was written in
2 CONC  the record as Philippe de Pres between 14 June 1699 and 9 August 1705. Name Record	The name of Philippe des Prez was written in the record as Philippe de Pret10 April 1701.  Name Record The name of Philippe des Prez was writtenin
2 CONC  the record as Philippe des Pres 2 October 1707. Name Record The name of Philippe des Prez was written in the record as Filip des Prees 7April 1709. Name Record: The name of Philippe des Prez was written inthe record as Philip dù 
2 CONC Pree 27 September 1711. Family Elisabeth Prévost b. 31 Oct 1683, d. 18 Jan 1750 Children:   :# Marie des Pres b. b 14 Jun 1699  :# Hercules du Preez b. b 10 Apr 1701, d. b 21 Jan 1720 :# Martha des Prez+ b. c 1703, d. b 25 Dec 172
2 CONC 9 • Philippe du Preez+b. b 4  Apr 1705, d. 1765  :# David des Prez b. b 7 Apr 1709  :# Jacob des Prez+ b. b 27 Sep 1711  :# Cecilia des Prez+ b. b 14 May 1713  :# Charel des Pree b. b 16 Feb 1716  :# Hester de Pree b. b 27 Feb 171
2 CONC 8  :# Hercules des Pree b. b 21 Jan 1720  :# Davidt des Pree b. b 5 Jul 1721 
