2 PLAC Twee Jonge Gezellen
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tulbagh
3 STAE Caap de Goede Hoop
3 CTRY Suid Afrika
1 OCCU Farmer
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} bc6 Jacob
2 CONT
2 CONT » 27.9.1711, boer Tulbagh, † Tulbagh 4.2.1747; x Drakenstein 28.5.1741 Susanna Maria Theron, d.v. Jacobus Theron
2 CONT
2 CONT G R - C C de Villiers Vol 2 bygewerk deur Cor Pama
2 CONT
2 CONT =========================================
2 CONT
2 CONT [Jacobus du Preez (1711 – 1749) had indeed lived, worked & died on Twee Jonge Gezellen.
2 CONT
2 CONT He hired / loaned the farm from one of our family ancestors, the widow Margaretha Pasman, after her husband Barend Burgert died in 1729.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacobus du Preez married Maria Susanna Theron (1724 - 1797) on the 28th of May 1741.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jacobus du Preez died on Twee Jonge Gezellen on 4 Feb 1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT His widow, Maria Susanna Theron then got remarried to Jan Gysbert Olivier (1725 – 1797) on 5 March 1752. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Jan Gysbert Olivier was the son of one of the original Twee Jonge Gezellen (two young bachelors), who were our direct ancestors.
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: Jacobus du Preez is linked to us (Krone-family) by 12 steps (not directly related though).
2 CONT
2 CONT HISTORY TWEE JONGE GEZELLEN:
2 CONT
2 CONT Barend Burgert (1692 – 1729) and Jan Olivier (1683 - ?) were the original “Two Young Bachelors” (the ‘Twee Jonge Gezellen’) who lived on the Farm
2 CONT
2 CONT Twee Jonge Gezellen in 1710. Barend Burgert married Margaretha Pasman in 1712, and Barend’s sister Helena Burgert (1701 - ?) married Jan Oliver
2 CONT
2 CONT in 1717 (effectively making the two young bachelors into brothers-in-law). Jan Oliver and Helena Burgert had a son Jan Gysbert Olivier (1725 – 1797).
2 CONT
2 CONT I do not know if there were any graves (for the Du Preez's) on Twee Jonge Gezellen (I have never heard of any) - as far as I've been able to find out the burial grounds in Tulbagh at that time were at the old "Kruis-Vallei gemeent
2 CONC e begrafplaas".]
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Source: Matt Krone (Owner-famliy of Twee Jongen Gezellen, Tulbagh), 3 Jan 2011''
2 CONT
2 CONT MATTHEW  KRONE
2 CONT Twee Jonge Gezellen Tulbagh
2 CONT --------------------
