2 CONT =Philippus Botha=
2 CONT child of [http://www.geni.com/people/Theunis-Botha/6000000005788458301?through=6000000001580940776 Theunis Botha], b bef 15 April 1686. Called Botha after his mother, [http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Kickers/4705796237050024653?t
2 CONC hrough=6000000005788458301 Maria Kickers]' , 1700 divorce from [http://www.geni.com/people/Jan-Cornelisz/4141861275630023780?through=4705796237050024653 Jan Cornelisz] (who is shown as his father on the birth certificate). At whic
2 CONC h time  she said her 7 children were [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-Botha-SV-PROG/5356428241620125193?through=4705796237050024653 Frederich Botha]'s. However, a recent DNA  [http://repository.up.ac.za/bitstream/handle/2263/
2 CONC 32007/Greeff_Appel(2013).pdf?sequence=1 study  by  the University of Pretoria]  reveal him to have been the biological son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Ferdinandus-Appel-b2/6000000001580940776?through=6000000005788458301 Ferdina
2 CONC ndus Appel].'''
