1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://www.geni.com/threads/6000000018886347677
2 CONT
2 CONT Johannes, b15, is not mentioned in his father's inventory, suggesting that he had died before 4 November 1750.
2 CONT
2 CONT I want to suggest that the Johannes Fourie who married Cecilia Johanna du Preez was the son of Louis and Susanna le Riche, baptised 29 November 1733 at Stellenbosch.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children were baptised at Tulbagh. Susanna Maria's witnesses were 'Joseph Le Riers, en Susanna Le Ries' See http://www.eggsa.org/cgi-bin/searchBaptisms.pl. - JS
