2 CONT
2 CONT •	Are you a male descendant below here?  •	Descendants of 7 of 8 grandsons of  Joost Strydom test the same yDNA - proving that the original Strijdom/Strydom yDNA is R-M269 = the deeper clade R-L51 = deeper to R-ZZ12_1 = still deep
2 CONC er to R-L617 and currently = deepest to R-BY31988. •	If you are in this line we need your yDNA test to help solve the mystery of at what point some of the descendants of b4c3d3e1 Hendrik Josephus  b.1775 acquired the yDNA  E-M35 =
2 CONC  E-Z5018  of the South African male “La Roux” surname. •	We know it happened with or after b4c3d3e1 Hendrik Josephus  b.1775, because a descendant of his youngest brother b4c3d3e11 Petrus Jacobus b.1791 tests the same as the major
2 CONC ity of the other Strydom lines.  •	Go to this web page to find out how to get a free yDNA test in the Strydom surname project: https://www.familytreedna.com/groups/strydom
