2 CONT Maria Rossard was born before 19 October 1666, in Mer, Loir-et-Cher, France, her father, Jacob Rossard, was 37 and her mother, Ester Rousseau, was 32. She married Jan Jansz Van Eeden on 13 June 1688, in Cape Town, Cape of Good Hop
2 CONC e, South Africa. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 1 daughter. She died in Cape of Good Hope, South Afric
