1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cape Civil Deaths - Entry : 7951  Filed 23 July 1845 - David Benjamin Janse van Rensburg passed away on 12 June 1845 at his residence on the farm ' De Draai ' Swellendam District of the Cape Colony. He was aged 68 
2 CONC years, a farmer and a widower who left movable property and outstanding debts to the value of about £ 500
