2 CONC 39678?through=6000000005787831256]. Margo and Christo's great-grandson, [ Esaias Reynier SNYMAN, b7c1d7 ], descended from their son Philippe Rudolf, married [https://www.geni.com/people/Emerentia-Meyer-SV2b4c5d2/600000000168561509
2 CONC 6?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1543079856255&through=6000000001685615096 ]. On Emerentia's mother's side, she was also a great-granddaughter of Margo and Christo, but descended from their first daughter Maria Magdalena. Her father's g
2 CONC reat-grandmother was  [https://www.geni.com/people/Anna-van-der-Meer-van-Berendrecht/6000000006882119182?from_flash=1&fsession_id=1543079856255&through=6000000001685615096], who was a descendent of the counts of Hainaut and Flande
2 CONC rs and thereby of Holy Roman Emperors stretching back into the first millennium. 
