1 NOTE Notes
2 CONT <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
2 CONT           "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
2 CONT <html  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en"><head>
2 CONT <title></title>
2 CONT <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8"/>
2 CONT <meta http-equiv="Content-Style-Type" content="text/css"/>
2 CONT </head>
2 CONT <body>
2 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt">He was christened on 21 Jun 1778.<sup> </sup></span></font><a href="http://pottassjj.com/pottas/fowsrc.htm" \l "764"><font face="Times New Roman"
2 CONC  size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt"><u><sup>(764)</sup></u></span></font></a><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span 
2 CONT style="font-size:11pt"> He signed a will on 11 Dec 1822 in Uitenhage, Oos-Kaap. 
2 CONT (KAB MOOC 7/1/93.88) Hulle gesamentlike testament word opgestel en onderteken terwyl hulle 
2 CONT op 'n plaas in die distrik woon. In die geval van 'n tweede huwelik deur die langslewende moet die 
2 CONT boedel ten gelde gemaak word en die gelde beskikbaar gemaak word ten voordeel van hul huidige 
2 CONT huwelik se kinders. He died before 9 Jun 1826. (KAB MOOC 13/1/57.10) Hy word as reeds 
2 CONT oorlede vermeld in sy vader se likwidasie en distrubusie rekening. Hy is getroud op 11 November 
2 CONT 1798 met Cornelia Botha, = 14/05/1780. Sy is die dogter van Theunis Botha en Anna Margaretha 
2 CONT Potgieter. Hy is 'n vryburger van Graaff-Reinet</span></font></div>
2 CONT </body>
2 CONT </html>
