2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of the oldest son of the VOGEL progenitor in South Africa, Johann Christian VOGEL. The son had the same names as his father. Source: Die Families van Ou Swellendam Deel 1: Steyn, footnote 37 on page 21.
