2 CONT </head>
2 CONT <body>
2 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt">She was christened on 18 Apr 1784.</span></font><a href="http://pottassjj.com/pottas/fowsrc.htm" \l "767"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><
2 CONC span style="font-size:11pt"><u><sup> (767)</sup></u></span></font></a><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span 
2 CONT style="font-size:11pt"> She signed a will on 27 Apr 1818 in Swellendam, Wes-
2 CONT Kaap. (KAB MOOC 7/1/136.140) Hulle gemeenskaplike testament word opgestel en ondertekne 
2 CONT terwyl hulle op 'n plaas in die distrik woon. She died on 29 Sep 1857 in Richmond, Noord-Kaap. 
2 CONT (KAB MOOC 6/9/56.1163) Sy sterf op die plaas Varkfontein. Sy is getroud op 23 Oktober 1803 
2 CONT met Hermanus Steyn, = 26/09/1784. Hy is die seun van Johannes Steyn en Barbara Wilhelmina 
2 CONT Vogel. Hulle is neef en niggie. Hy is 'n vryburger van Stellenbosch. </span></font></div>
2 CONT </body>
2 CONT </html>
