1 OCCU Van Amsterdam, Nederland. Arriveer 1735 as matroos aan boord van die 'Paddenburg'. Burger in 1744, Farmer
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Marriage  of Catharina Hoffman to Willem Landman 
2 CONT
2 CONT NGK Tulbagh, Cape of Good Hope
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1747, den 10 Maart of den 26 Maart Willem Landman van Amsterdam, jongman burger in de vergleege districten met Catharina Hofman van Cabo de goede Hoop, wedw. wijlen Fredrik Schepers'''
2 CONT
2 CONT - Nederduits Gereformeerde Gemeente (NGK), Tulbagh, Western Cape. marriage register, 1744-1839, page 2, entry no 2. Repository: NG Kerkargief, Noordwal-Wes, Stellenbosch, G4 9/1. on http://www.eggsa.org/cgi-bin/searchMarriages.pl 
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Volgens SAG 5 was hy van Amsterdam afkomstig en arriveer in 1735 as matroos op die "Paddenburg". Hy word vryburger in 1744. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=erasmussa&id=I1851
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT WILLEM LANDMAN (STAMVADER)
2 CONT
2 CONT Willem LANDMAN hy was van Amsterdam en kom in 1735 aan by die Kaap as 'n matroos op die Paddenburg. Hy word 'n burgher in 1744.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hy trou op 10 Maart 1747 in die Paarl met Catharina HOFMANN. Sy was gedoop 1 Mei 1707 en was die dogter van Johannes Hoffman en Maria Louisa van de Kaap.
2 CONT
2 CONT Hy trou die tweede keer in die Paarl op 29 Mei 1768 met Johanna JONKER sy was gedoop 29 September 1747 en was die dogter van Adolph Jonker en Maria Petronella Langeveld.
2 CONT
2 CONT KINDERS Nege
2 CONT
2 CONT Landman sterwe April 1778.
2 CONT --------------------
