1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Baptismal record "South Africa, Dutch Reformed Church Registers (Cape Town Archives), 1660-1970 ," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HT-DRHS-MXD?cc=1478678&wc=M6GW-8PD%3A
2 CONC 49605401%2C49605402%2C49605403%2C49620901 : 21 May 2014), South Africa > Cape of Good Hope > Cape Town > Baptisms 1780-1786 > image 69 of 100; State Archives, Cape Province.
2 CONT
2 CONT Danielina Johanna POTGIETER, gedoop 2 Mei 1784 in Swellendam, verw. nr. b1c8d2e4. Baie variasies in haar naam kom voor: Danila; SAG toon haar naam as Carolina Johanna en sy kom voor as Dalena in die doop register van haar dogter. 
2 CONC In haar eie doopgegewens is haar naam Danalina Johanna.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Sy trou (1) Willem Frederik PRINSLOO, trou 17 Jan 1802 in Graaff-Reinet, (seun van Willem PRINSLOO en Maria Elizabeth KLOPPER) gedoop 25 Apr 1779, verw. nr. b2c3d5e1. Willem: Burger Graaff-Reinet.
2 CONT * Sy trou (2) Hendrik Petrus KLOPPER, trou 4 Sep 1808 in Graaff-Reinet, (seun van Hendrik Coenraad KLOPPER en Susanna Catharina BOTHA) gedoop 10 Aug 1787, s. 20 Mrt 1868 in Winburg, verw. nr. b7c2d1. Hendrik: hy xx Aletta Maria Gr
2 CONC eyling.
2 CONT
2 CONT - Potgieter Register
