2 CONC 4.5.1730 † Maart 1782 d.v. Cornelis van Rooyen en Jacomyntje van Deventer
2 CONT
2 CONT d7 Jesaias Reynier » 1.1.1764 x 11.5.1783 Amerentia MEYER » 8.11.1767 d.v. Isaias (Jesaias) Meyer en Ambrensia (Emerentia) Botha '''xx George 5.12.1813 Hester Elizabeth FOUCHE » Tulbagh 4.5.1794 d.v. Philip Jacobus Fouche en Magda
2 CONC lena Cilliers'''
2 CONT
2 CONT The above  can not be correct as the man that died 1843 was 55 years old  , born 1788 (in fact it was the son of d7, Esaias Rynier Engelbertus Snyman, who was married to Hester Elizabeth Fouche and Jacomina Sttoffelina Snyman, but
2 CONC  the DN below does not show his parents unfortunately)
2 CONT
