2 CONT
2 CONT Haplogroup I-M253 (alias I1, prev. I1a) - Z60 subclade (prev. I1a2a).
2 CONT
2 CONT A descendant of Christoffel's son Philippus (b7) has tested positive in April 2014 for: I1 M253+ Z60+ (The haplogroup I-M253 is also referred to as I1d1a)
2 CONT
2 CONT Haplogroup I-M253 (Y-DNA) is the original paternal lineage of Nordic Europe (Z60 is a subclade under this haplogroup). The highest frequencies of the I-M253 lineage are now found in Scandinavian countries. I-M253 males are current
2 CONC ly present throughout Europe, consisting of about 40 percent of the male population of Norway, 35 percent of Finland, between 10 and 11 percent of French, about 18 percent of German and between 10 and 22 percent of the British Isl
2 CONC es.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Geno 2.0 test results by the Geneographic Project of National Geographic
