2 CONT -------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Inventory and appraisement of the effects left by the intestate death of '''Coenraad Scheepers''', who '''departed this life on the 29:th August 1829''' at the place called Dekselfontyn situated in the Field Cornetcy of Under Bush
2 CONC man River '''aged about 83 years''' to his four surviving aged children begotten in marriage by his deceased wife '''Elsje Oosthuyzen''' named Magdalena Scheepers, Frederik Johannes Scheepers, Petronella Scheepers, Johannes Marthi
2 CONC nus Scheepers and to their surviving twelve grand children and to their great grand child, see the names per annexed list, an account of the aforesaid estate has been taken in writing by the field cornet C:V: Buchner and the under
2 CONC signed witnesses and consists as follows, viz:
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Names of the grand children and great grand child, viz:
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1) the following three aged grand children procreated in wedlock by the late Catharina Elizabeth Scheepers, who was married to the late Hendrik Breytenbach, named 	
2 CONT * Johan Hendrik Breytenbach
2 CONT * Johan Jacobus Breytenbach and
2 CONT * Coenraad Velter Breytenbach and the minor great grand child 	
2 CONT * Gerbrecht Catharina Susanna Vermaak who was procreated by the late Gerbrecht Susanna Breytenbach who was married to Coenraad Marthinus Vermaak
2 CONT * 2) the following five aged grand children procreated in wedlock by the late Gerhardus Scheepers, who was married to Anna Margaretha Rensburg, named 	
2 CONT * Coenraad Scheepers
2 CONT * Elsje Magdalena Johanna Scheepers
2 CONT * Marthinus Ernestus Sheepers
2 CONT * Anna Magdalena Scheepers and
2 CONT * Gerrit Johannis A: Scheepers
2 CONT * 3) the following two aged grand and one minor child procreated in wedlock by the late Johanna Scheepers who was married to Cornelis Tobias Vermaak, named 	
2 CONT * Elsje Vermaak
2 CONT * Maria Vermaak and 	
2 CONT * Johanna Vermaak a minor
2 CONT * 4) and the following aged grand child procreated in wedlock by the late Elsje Scheepers who was married to Frederik Johannes Potgieter, named 	
2 CONT * Elsje Magdalena Petronella Potgieter
2 CONT
2 CONT Kruysfontein 31 October 1829
2 CONT
2 CONT As witnesses: signed: C:F: Scheepers F: son, C: Scheepers G:t son
2 CONT
2 CONT Signed: C: V: Buchner, Field C:t
2 CONT
2 CONT Zertieveert als dat ik op heden den 31 October 1829 meij hebben begeven ter platze van de wedewe Gert Scheepers genaamt Kruijsfontijn en al daar en present van den na te melde getuigen onder inventaris genoomen hebben de volgende 
2 CONC goederen het nalatenschap van den overledenen Coenderaad Scheepers de oude overleden op den 29:st Augustus 1829 zijnde er gene testament werdende als
2 CONT
2 CONT ...
2 CONT
2 CONT Namen der erft genaamen
2 CONT * 1) Magdalena Scheepers huijs vrouw van J: Meijer
2 CONT * 2) Fredrik Johannis Scheepers Coenderaad zoon
2 CONT * 3) Martinus Esaias Janse van Renssenburgt gehuwd met Petronella Scheepers
2 CONT * 4) Johannis Martunus Scheepers C:zoon
2 CONT * 1) de kinderen van den overledenen Catrina Elizabeth Bredenbagt gebore Scheepers voor een staat, met name 	
2 CONT * J:H: Bredenbagt 	
2 CONT * Johan Jacobus Bredenbagt
2 CONT * Coenderat Velter Bredenbagt alle mondig en
2 CONT * weeskint van den overledene Gerbregt Susanna Jacoba Bredenbagt met name 
2 CONT * Gerbregt Catrina Susanna Vermaakt onmondigt
2 CONT * 2) de staakt van den overledenen Gerhardus Scheepers Coenderaad zoon 	
2 CONT * C: Scheepers Gert zoon
2 CONT * Elsie Magdalena Johanna Scheepers
2 CONT * Martunus Es:is Scheepers
2 CONT * Anna Marragritha Scheepers
2 CONT * Gert Johannis A:m Scheepers Gert zoon
2 CONT * 3) de staak van den overledenen Johanna Scheepers 	
2 CONT * Elsie Vermaak 	mondigt
2 CONT * Maria Vermaak
2 CONT * Johanna Vermaak 	onmondigt
2 CONT * 4) staak van den overledenen Elsie Scheepers een kint nagelate 	
2 CONT * Elsie Magdalena Petronella Potgieter 	mondigt
2 CONT
2 CONT Kruijs Vontuijn den 31 October 1829
2 CONT
