1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Variants first name: Ricx / Rixt / Rikstje
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:
2 CONT
2 CONT About 1631 - see baptism information below. On her marriage certificate it is stated that she is from Weidum, which at the time was located in the Baarderadeel municipal area. Nowadays it is in the Littenseradiel municipal area.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: this information is probably not applicable to Rikstje. See explanation below. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Baptism:
2 CONT
2 CONT In Friesland at the time, a child had the first name of the father as patronym (used in the place of a surname). This was the case most of the time, but not always.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sometimes the patronym of the father also became the patronym of the child. If this was the case for Rikstje, then the following information could be of her, but it is not certain at this stage:
2 CONT
2 CONT Leeuwarden, dopen, doopjaar 1632
2 CONT
2 CONT Dopeling: Ricx
2 CONT
2 CONT Gedoopt op 1 januari 1632 in Leeuwarden
2 CONT
2 CONT Dochter van Jense Egberts en niet genoemde moeder
2 CONT
2 CONT Gestandaardiseerde namen (voornaam en patroniem):
2 CONT
2 CONT Dopeling  : RIKSTJE
2 CONT
2 CONT Vader   : IENSE EGBERTS
2 CONT
2 CONT Bron: Collectie Doop-, Trouw-, Begraaf- en Lidmaatboeken (DTBL); Herv. gem. Leeuwarden, doop 1627-1635; Inventarisnr. : DTB 928
2 CONT
2 CONT Op microfiche beschikbaar op studiezaal Tresoar
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.tresoar.nl/polpel/as_web.exe?dregio09+D+5723693
2 CONT
2 CONT Wijzigingsdatum: 19-12-2006
2 CONT
2 CONT If the customary use of patronym was used for Rikstje, she would have been known as Rikstje Jenses and then the above information would not be applicable to her.
2 CONT
2 CONT More research needs to be done.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage:
2 CONT
2 CONT Leeuwarden, huwelijken 1657
2 CONT
2 CONT Vermelding: Ondertrouw in 1657
2 CONT
2 CONT Man       : Douwe Gerbens afkomstig van Weidum
2 CONT
2 CONT Vrouw     : Rixt Egberts afkomstig van Weidum
2 CONT
2 CONT Gestandaardiseerde namen: DOUWE GERBENS en RIKSTJE EGBERTS
2 CONT
2 CONT Bron: Collectie Doop-, Trouw-, Begraaf- en Lidmatenboeken(DTBL); Trouwregister Gerecht Leeuwarden 1653-1663; Inventarisnr.: 902
2 CONT
2 CONT Op microfiche beschikbaar op de studiezaal van Tresoar
2 CONT
2 CONT And:
2 CONT
2 CONT Leeuwarden, huwelijken 1657
2 CONT
2 CONT Vermelding: Bevestiging huwelijk op 18 maart 1657
2 CONT
2 CONT Man       : Douwe Gerbens afkomstig van Weidum
2 CONT
2 CONT Vrouw     : Rixt Egberts afkomstig van Weidum
2 CONT
2 CONT Gestandaardiseerde namen: DOUWE GERBENS en RIKSTJE EGBERTS
2 CONT
2 CONT Bron: Collectie Doop-, Trouw-, Begraaf- en Lidmatenboeken(DTBL); Trouwregister Hervormde gemeente Leeuwarden 1655-1664; Inventarisnr.: 978
2 CONT
2 CONT Op microfiche beschikbaar op de studiezaal van Tresoar
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Most probably they had two sons together - Age Douwes and Gerben Douwes. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Death:
2 CONT
2 CONT She did not emigrate to South Africa with Douwe, reason unknown. Most probably Douwe left for South Africa after she died.  Her death date is estimated to be before Douwe Gerbens left for South Africa since she is never mentioned 
2 CONC in any official document written by Douwe Gerbrandt STEYN in South Africa.
