1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Most probably the first child of Douwe Gerbens. He remained behind in the Netherlands with his mother and younger brother when his father Douwe Gerbens (later known as Douwe Gerbrandt STEYN) emigrated to South Afri
2 CONC ca.
2 CONT
2 CONT Names in various documents:
2 CONT
2 CONT Aege Douwes - own baptismal record DTB 931 Collectie Herv. Gemeente Leeuwarden
2 CONT
2 CONT Agge Douwes - baptismal record of his son Isaack DTB Amsterdam 88, p.272 (16 Jun 1686)
2 CONT
2 CONT Agge Douwese - baptism record of the same sone in the other transcription of the same, DTB Amsterdam 87 p.302
2 CONT
2 CONT Age Douwes Ee - baptism record of his daughter Metje DTB Amsterdam 89 p7 (25 Dec 1691)
2 CONT
2 CONT Age Douwessen - baptism record of his daughter Cornelia DTB Amsterdam 98 p.161 (9 Nov 1689)
2 CONT
2 CONT Age Douwesen - baptism record of his daughter Rensie DTB Amsterdam 98 p.84 (4 Feb 1688)
2 CONT
2 CONT Aege Douwes - baptismal record
2 CONT
2 CONT Age Douwestijn - baptism witness record of his grandson Pieter DTB Amsterdam DTB 89 p.154 (folio 77v) nr.2 (15 Jun 1712)
2 CONT
2 CONT Agge Douwesz Steijn - burial record
2 CONT
2 CONT Official name as found on the website of the city of Leeuwarden in the digitalized list NH Doopboeken Leeuwarden 1603-1811: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name child: Aege Douwes
2 CONT
2 CONT Name father: Douwe Gerbens
2 CONT
2 CONT Date of baptism: 11.10.1661
2 CONT
2 CONT No name of mother mentioned here, but that is normal for this list.
2 CONT
2 CONT Also:
2 CONT
2 CONT Leeuwarden, dopen, doopjaar 1661
2 CONT
2 CONT Dopeling: Aege
2 CONT
2 CONT Gedoopt op 11 oktober 1661 in Leeuwarden
2 CONT
2 CONT Zoon van Douwe Gerbens en niet genoemde moeder
2 CONT
2 CONT Gestandaardiseerde namen (voornaam en patroniem):
2 CONT
2 CONT Dopeling  : AGE
2 CONT
2 CONT Vader   : DOUWE GERBENS
2 CONT
2 CONT Bron:
2 CONT
2 CONT Collectie Doop-, Trouw-, Begraaf- en Lidmaatboeken (DTBL)
2 CONT
2 CONT Herv. gem. Leeuwarden, doop 1654-1667
2 CONT
2 CONT Inventarisnr. : 931
2 CONT
2 CONT Op microfiche beschikbaar op studiezaal Tresoar
2 CONT
2 CONT Wijzigingsdatum: 19-12-2006
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: In the Frisian culture of the time it was the custom to use the father's first name as the 'surname' or patronym. Thus Age, the son of Douwe GERBENS would have the full name of Age DOUWES (Age, Douwe's son). And having the n
2 CONC ame Douwe GERBENS would mean that the first name of Douwe's father was Gerben. 
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the article in Die Huisgenoot he inherited property in the town of Weidom which is in the vicinity of Leeuwarden and another property near Amsterdam - mentioned in a document dated 18 May 1687 and in the testament of 
2 CONC Douw Gerbrand STEYN dated 31 August 1699. For more information see the notes on the page of his father.
2 CONT
2 CONT Name variants: Aage / Age / Aege / Aages 
2 CONT
2 CONT Age was witness at the baptism of Madeleentie (granddaughter of Age), daughter of Kornelis Pieters and Kornelia Ages (daughter of Age) see extract from the baptismal records of Amsterdam Municipality:
2 CONT
2 CONT dochter Madeleentie
2 CONT
2 CONT vader Kornelis Pieters
2 CONT
2 CONT moeder Kornelia Ages
2 CONT
2 CONT getuigen Age Douwese en Madeleentie Boor
2 CONT
2 CONT pastor Johannes Cramer
2 CONT
2 CONT doop 29 maart 1711
2 CONT
2 CONT religie Hervormd, Oosterkerk
2 CONT
2 CONT bron 89 p. 141 (folio 71) nr. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT And also at the baptism of Pieter (grandson of Age)
2 CONT
2 CONT zoon Pieter
2 CONT
2 CONT vader Kornelis Pieters Vooren
2 CONT
2 CONT moeder Kornelia Ages
2 CONT
2 CONT getuigen Age Douwestijn
2 CONT
2 CONT Aeltie Daal
2 CONT
2 CONT pastor Florentius Bomble
2 CONT
2 CONT doop 15 juni 1712
2 CONT
2 CONT religie Hervormd, Oosterkerk
2 CONT
2 CONT bron 89 p. 154 (folio 77v) nr. 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Age had another grandson, Cornelis
2 CONT
2 CONT zoon Cornelis
2 CONT
2 CONT vader Cornelis Pietterse Voorn
2 CONT
2 CONT moeder Cornelia Ages
2 CONT
2 CONT getuigen Gerrit de Wit
2 CONT
2 CONT Magdaleena van Veen
2 CONT
2 CONT pastor Hugo van der Helst
2 CONT
2 CONT doop 16 april 1719
2 CONT
2 CONT religie Hervormd, Oosterkerk
2 CONT
2 CONT bron 89 p. 207 (folio 104) nr. 7
