2 CONT
2 CONT *Steynsburg (C 2125 BD). Town 64 km south-west of Burgersdorp and 48 km north of Hofmeyr. It developed around the Dutch Reformed Church established in 1872 and has been administered by a village management board since 1874. Named 
2 CONC after Douwe Gerbrandt Steyn, grandfather of President Paul Kruger. 
2 CONT
