2 CONT                                  .         ‘                                                         Se agterkleinseun was                     .      .                                                          .                    
2 CONC                                                                                 Kommandant Generaaal Andries Hendrik Potgieter 
2 CONT
2 CONT                                                                    V                                                               V .              .                           Hermanus d'Oude Steyn       (Neef x Niggie)           
2 CONC Martha Potgieter                           .                   .                         Hermanus d'Oude was the father of                                                                                                    .       
2 CONC        .     President Hermanus Steyn (Hermanus d'Jonge)                                                                                                          .               .                 of the Swellendamse Republiek.    
2 CONC                                                                                                                             .              He was also the 2nd Great Grand Father of                                                  
2 CONC                                        .              .                               .                                                 President Paul Kruger,                                                                        
2 CONC                                           .              .              as well as the Great Granduncle of                                                                                                      .             .       
2 CONC                                           President M T Steyn.                                                                                   
