2 CONT
2 CONT Pieter Fourie was baptized on 7 February 1717 at Nederduitsch Gereformeerde Kerk, Drakenstein, de Caep de Goede Hoop. The baptism was witnessed by Pierre Jourdaan.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage*
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Isabella Steyn on 22 February 1767 at Paarl.3 
