2 CONT Hermanus Steyn was a burgher of Stellenbosch, Kliprivier according to Jacques Steyn internet information http://www.steyn.pro/genealogy/steyn/douwe/1784-09-26.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT Three Steyns owned the farm Kliprivier dist Swellendam according to EH Burrows in his book Overberg Outspan. 
2 CONT 1. Johannes Steyn b1c3d12 owner 1776 - 1814  
2 CONT 2. Hermanus Steyn b1c3d12e4 owner January - July 1814 
2 CONT 3. Marthinus Steyn b1c8d13 owner 1815 - 1837
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo's of Klip Rivier homestead http://digital.lib.sun.ac.za/handle/10019.2/1877
2 CONT
2 CONT Hermanus was buried at Kliprivier
