2 CONT
2 CONT Louis Fourie was baptised around 1703. He lived in Drakenstein. He was married on 1728.05.16 to Susanna le Riche. They had 12 children
2 CONT * c1 Louis ~1729.04.102.
2 CONT * c2 Susanna ~1731.03.11, married Jacobus Steyn ~1723.04.25 - 1801.12.303.
2 CONT * c3 Johannes ~1733.11.29
2 CONT * c4 Pieter 1735.10.16
2 CONT * c5 Francina ~1737.10.13, 1.i. at Paarl on 1756.03.28 married Johannes Andries Holtshausen 2.ii on 1793.05.19 married Izaak van der Vyver
2 CONT * c6 Anna ~1739.09.06, on 1758.03.26 married Johannes Petrus la Grange
2 CONT * c7 Maria ~1741.07.02, on 1761.03.22 married Marthinus la Grange
2 CONT * c8 Jacobus ~1743.10.209.
2 CONT * c9 Martha ~1745.06.12, on 1765.10.27 married Lourens de Jager
2 CONT * c10 Joseph ~1747.10.1211.
2 CONT * c11 Petronella ~1750.10.25, married P Muller
2 CONT * c12 Elizabeth ~1752.04.02 (Tulbagh) - 1825.03.16, married PR Botha
