2 CONT Joseph Fourie Age   Married to: Anna Margaretha van Rensburg  Baptised 1747.10.12 Died   Born   Died . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents Father Louis Fourie Children Boys 4 Date of marriage: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother Susanna le Riche 11 Girls 7 1778.02.22 
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Fourie was baptised on 1747.10.12 and was married on 1778.02.22 to Anna Margaretha van Rensburg. They had 11 children
2 CONT * 1.d1 Maria Elisabeth ~1779.03.07, married at Graaff-Reinet on 1805.09.02 Jan Andries Broodryk
2 CONT * 2.d2 Louis Jacobus ~1780.08.20
2 CONT * 3.d3 Susanna Johanna ~1782.07.28, married David Benjamin van Rensburg
2 CONT * 4.d4 Joseph ~1784.02.08
2 CONT * 5.d5 Sophia Elisabeth ~1786.09.29
2 CONT * 6.d6 Anna Margaretha ~1789.05.07, married Johannes Jacobus Meyer
2 CONT * 7.d7 Maria Elisabeth ~1789.10.18, at Cape Town on 1804.11.11 married Jacobus Herculus de Jager
2 CONT * 8.d8 Johannes Frederik ~1791.09.19
2 CONT * 9.d9 Josina Wilhelmina ~1794.02.28, married Gerrit Oosthuyzen
2 CONT * 10.d10 Emerentia Frederica Jacoba ~1796.02.20, married Jacobus Oosthuyzen
2 CONT * 11.d11 Josephus ~1798.03.17
2 CONT
