1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Alternate spelling second name: Elizabeth / Elisabeth Alternate spelling surname: Steyn / Steijn  (in the Dutch language these two 'y' and 'ij' were readily exchanged and treated as being the same).  For the sake o
2 CONC f simplifying matters on Geni, we tend to use Steyn rather than Steijn in line with the usage in SAG 12 and in Die families van ou Swellendam deel 1: Steyn. Because her husband Barend Christiaan Crous only married his second wife 
2 CONC on 7 March 1836 i assume that the first children was born out of there marraige and the children born after 1836 belongs to the second mother who was Helena Aletta Du Plessis born circa 1810.
