2 CONT "Voortrekker Stamouers" - Jan C. Visagie: STEYN, PETRUS HERMANUS: Gedoop te Graaff-Reinet 17/8/1800 Oorlede te Potchefstroom op 9/2/1896. Trou te Graaff-Reinet met Jacoba Elizabeth de Beer. WOONPLEK: Distrik Beaufort en later dist
2 CONC rik George VERTREKDATUM:Onbekent. Omstreeks 1844 reeds in die binneland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Pieter Hermanus Steyn passed away on 9 February 1896 on the farm ' Buffelskloof ' Vaal Rivier Wyk, Transvaal. He was aged 95 years, a farmer and a widower who left no immovable, movable assets or a will.
