2 TITL The Drostdy Swellendam in 1877
1 NOTE Hiervandaan verder is die familielyn wat hier nagevolg word, onnaspeurbaar tot en met: Pieter Gysbert x Maria Cornelia Gertruida ?  Dit moet nog bevestig word.
2 CONT ---
2 CONT Internet: The loan-farm was acquired in 1816 by agriculturist, Marthinus Steyn (born 1775, and spelt Steijn). He was father of wainwright (wagonmaker), Pieter Gysbert Steyn (born 1805), who later became the owner of The Drostdy, a
2 CONC nd Marthinus was also the grandfather of President M T Steyn of the Orange Free State Republic.
2 CONT (See Picture)
2 CONT Bron: http://www.klipperivier.com/html/history_steyn.htm
2 CONT ---
2 CONT Dalk b1c6d13e3. Vroue se name verskil egter. (De Villiers & Pama)
2 CONT ---
