2 CONT
2 CONT Maria Christina Francina Linde ( nee Steyn ) passed away on 23 April 1846 at ' Hariglik ' ? Hantam, District of Blesburg, Cape Colony. She was aged 30 years and was married to George Frederik Linde.
2 CONT
2 CONT Marie left property of about £ 2000
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Notice signed at Colesberg on 15 May 1846 by : G.F. Linde - Surviving Dpouse  
