2 CONT Jan ( John ) Gysbert Steyn Died on 25 January 1896 aged 73 years in Swellendam. He was Married and a Member of Parliament and Died from ' Morbus Cardis ' having been ill for 81 days with Doctor G.J.Chadwick MBR being in attendance
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT He was Buried in the NG Kerk / Dutch Reformed Church Cemetery in Swellendam.
2 CONT
2 CONT Death Notice Witnessed by : M. Eksteen  - Cousin from Swellendam
2 CONT
2 CONT Signed : 28 January 1896  J.G. Coppens - Witness
