1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Johannes Frederik Hubertus Theunissen married Emerentia Wentzel 1/3/1807. 5 children. The last one Emerentia Elizabeth was born 1816.
2 CONT Johannes F then married Emerentia Johanna Botha 2/11/1817. 7 children 1819 -1830. One has to assume that his 1st wife has died before the 2nd marriage. The death date of both Emerentias are indicated on Family Search as 12/12/1859
2 CONC . This is however the death date of the 2nd husband of Emerentia Botha who married Mattheus Gerhardus Beukes born 1/5/1787, on 27/4/1843 in the year following the death of Johannes Frederik Theunissen on 30/8/1842. She was still a
2 CONC live when Gerhard died.
2 CONT SBrand 27/7/2026.
