2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Appel-29#DNA_study
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT * STAAT VAN INVENTARIS: https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-C9BY-DSPL-J?i=60&cat=220512
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geni.com/people/Theunis-Botha/6000000005788458301?through=6000000001580940776 Theunis Botha], b bef 15 April 1686. Called Botha after his mother, [http://www.geni.com/people/Maria-Kickers/4705796237050024653?through=600
2 CONC 0000005788458301 Maria Kickers]' , 1700 divorce from [http://www.geni.com/people/Jan-Cornelisz/4141861275630023780?through=4705796237050024653 Jan Cornelisz] (who is shown as his father on the birth certificate). At which time  sh
2 CONC e said her 7 children were [http://www.geni.com/people/Friedrich-Botha-SV-PROG/5356428241620125193?through=4705796237050024653 Frederich Botha]'s.  However, a recent DNA [http://repository.up.ac.za/bitstream/handle/2263/32007/Gree
2 CONC ff_Appel(2013).pdf?sequence=1 study  by  the University of Pretoria]  reveal him to have been the biological son of '''[http://www.geni.com/people/Ferdinandus-Appel-b2/6000000001580940776?through=6000000005788458301 Ferdinandus Ap
2 CONC pel].''''''
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''He was not married to Maria Kickers, but fathered one of her children, namely Theunis Botha, and therefore had Maria not married Friedrich Botha who (through association and marriage) adopted Theunis, the following ancestors, n
2 CONC amely Gen Louis Botha [https://www.geni.com/people/Louis-Botha/6000000002146719211] and P.W. Botha [https://www.geni.com/profile-80978170], should have had the surname Appel.
2 CONT '''
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000221120485985&size=large}}
2 CONT
2 CONT {{https://www.geni.com/media/proxy?media_id=6000000221121053824&size=large}}
2 CONT [https://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000123663725823 ''''Appel Botha Cornelitz : the abc of a three hundred year old divorce case'.''' Jaco M. Greeff & J. Christoff Erasmus Department of Genetics, University of Pretoria
2 CONC , Pretoria 0002, South Africa.]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''a1 Jurriaan Jansz Appel''' van Amsterdam, tree in 1658 uit die diens van die H.O.I.K. en word burger aan die Kaap. getroud: Jannetje Ferdinandus, van Kortryk.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''b2 Ferdinandus''' gedoop: 4 Oct 1665, burger Stellenbosch, getroud: Lavina Cloete. gesterf: 1717
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c1 Sophia''' gedoop: 22 Jul 1692, getroud: Barend van der Westhuizen, hertroud: Anthonie van Rooyen
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c2 Jurriaan''' gedoop: 2 Oct 1694, getroud: Eva Niemand
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c3 Johanna''' gedoop: 25 Dec 1701, getroud: Lambert Myburgh
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c4 Catharina''' gedoop: 26 Oct 1704, vergelyk: Nel
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c5 Maria''' gedoop: 29 Apr 1708
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c6 Abigael''' gedoop: 7 Dec 1710
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c7 Hans Jurgen''' getroud: 25 Dec 1739 Adriana Smit
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Ferdinandus Appel - a2b2 ~4/10/1665, leiersfiguur in vryburger gemeenskap asook burger van Stellenbosch.  Word luitenant in 1695 v kompanie voetsoldate vd burgerkommando.  In 1770 asook 1704 word hy verkies tot heemraad. ''' He
2 CONC t vername aandeel gehad in die verset teen Willem Adriaan vd Stel en agv sy aandeel hierin word hy na Nederland gestuur waar klagskrifte vd vryburgers aan die Here XVII oorhandig is, wat tot gevolg het dat vd Stel na Nederland ter
2 CONC uggeroep word.  Keer terug na SA in 1707.  Gedurende 1699 word grond aan hom toegeken naby die mond vd Eersterivier, wat later verdeel word in "Vergenoegd" en "Geduld".  Teen 1709 ontvang hy ook 'n leningsplaas dist Caledon † Kaap
2 CONC  c.1717 X 1692 Levina Cloete * 1677 † c. 1717 dv Gerrit Cloete en Catharina Harmans.  Erkenning: SA Biografiese Woordeboek, Vol III.  Bron: SAF1.
2 CONT
2 CONT >>_________
