1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Baptism:'''
2 CONT http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/e1250.htm
2 CONT '''Catrina, d'Vader Jacobùs Boota, d'Moeder Elsje Snyman''', 
2 CONT getù Hendrik Frederiksz Klopper en Catrina Bota: 7 Octob. 1714.
2 CONT
2 CONT AND - https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HY-6LW5-9Z?i=446&cc=1478678&cat=993523
2 CONT '''Name given as ''''''Catrina Botha''''''''' 
2 CONT '''
2 CONT '''
2 CONT Marriage:'''
2 CONT http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/e2886.htm
2 CONT Den 15 Augustus 1728. '''Martinus van Staden''' van Cabo de Goede Hoop Borger aan Drakenstein J.M. met ''''''Katharina Bota'''''' van Cabo voornoemt J.D.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT On 7th March 1727 she asked the Weeskamer to provide funds
2 CONT
2 CONT for the support and clothing of the minor Johanna Maria van den
2 CONT
2 CONT Brink since she had not received anything from the fathter, Warnar
2 CONT
2 CONT van den Brink for a considerable time. She was granted 2 rixdalers
2 CONT
2 CONT per month for this. The child had presumably been farmed out (besteet)
2 CONT
2 CONT by the Weeskamer to her to look after. (MOOC 1/5, page 6)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT 7 October 1714, the name of '''Catharina''' was written in the record as '''Catrina Boota'''. 15 August 1728, the name of Catharina was written in the record as Katharina Bota.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Her children are given as listed in the Estate Accounts of
2 CONT her father, Jacobus Botha de oude, drawn up between 1791 and 1793.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 7th March 1727 she asked the Weeskamer to provide funds for the support and clothing of the minor '''Johanna Maria van den Brink since she had not received anything from the father, Warnar van den Brink for a considerable time.
2 CONC ''' She was granted 2 rixdalersvper month for this.''' The child had presumably been farmed out (besteet) by the Weeskamer to her to look after'''. (MOOC 1/5, page 6)
2 CONT
