2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Marriage===
2 CONT [http://www.eggsa.org/cgi-bin/dosearchMarriages.pl eGGSA Marriage transcriptions]
2 CONT
2 CONT October 9 1802
2 CONT '''Martinus Christoffel Botha'''
2 CONT van Cabo de Goede Hoop
2 CONT status: Jongman
2 CONT occupation: Burger aan Zwellendam
2 CONT and
2 CONT '''Sara Maria Barnart'''
2 CONT van Cabo voornt., status: Jonge Dogter
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''': Nederduits Gereformeerde Gemeente (NGK), Cape Town, . marriage register, 1757-1803, page 2. Repository: NG Kerkargief, Noordwal-Wes, Stellenbosch, G1 13/2. Transcribed by Corney Keller, from photographs of Cape Archi
2 CONC ves VC 622.
2 CONT Note: The page following number 6 is stamped as number 10. The pages that follow 10 are numbered 9, 8, 7 ,11, 12, 13, ... etc. This suggests that (some) the pages were bound in a different order at the time of rubber stamping them
2 CONC , and corrected at a later date to order the pages chronologically.
2 CONT
