2 CONT '''1720, 14 Jan Thomas Verrijn wed. en Magdalena Munninks jonge dogter''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Cape Town Marriages 1713 to 1756 on http://www.ballfamilyrecords.co.uk/lombard/I651.html
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage to Pieter Paasen
2 CONT
2 CONT NGK Cape Town
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1722 12 Jul Pieter Paasen van Cabo jongm' en Magdalena Munninks van het Eyland Mauritius wed den siekenvader Thomas Verreijn''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Cape Town Marriages 1713 to 1756 on http://www.ballfamilyrecords.co.uk/lombard/I651.html Magdalena Munnickx 1  of Jan Harmens Gat 2  born Mauritius 3  died before 1791 4  will dated 30 June 1776 and filed 29 March 1782 5
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: Was her father Harman Gerritsz Munnick?
2 CONT
2 CONT In the Precis of the Archives of the Cape of Good Hope, Letters Received 1695-1708, by H.C.V. Leibbrandt, Cape Town, 1896, page 48, appears the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT (from Mauritius - 30 Sep 1695) We cannot refrain from mentioning the great fidelity displayed by the master woodcutter Dirk Ottense and two of his men, Harme Gerritse Munnick and Christoffel Jacobse of Dantzig, in saving the Compa
2 CONC ny's property on the plants.
2 CONT
2 CONT At the baptism of her third son, who was named Hermanus, the witnesses were Gerrit Munniks and Rachel Munniks. Were these her brother and sister?
2 CONT
2 CONT and from: http://voc.websilon.nl/ , the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT Persoonsgegevens van Gerrit Munnicx Herkomst: Mauritius. Rang: Matroos Datum einde verbintenis: 00/00/1727 Gerepatrieerd via schip: westfriessland Gegevens van de vaart Schip: Opperdoes Inventarisnr.: 14389 Kamer: Hoorn Folio: 63 
2 CONC Uitreis: 17-10-1725 Bestemming: Batavia DAS- en reisnr 2639.4 Aankomst: 19-05-1726 married (1) 14 January 1720 at Cape Town 6
2 CONT
