2 CONC ence Place:	 Gender:	 Age:	 Marital Status:	 Birth Date:	 Birth Year (Estimated):	 Father's Name:	 Mother's Name:	Gerbregje Boshouwer Parents' Residence Place:	 Spouse's Name:	 Spouse's Age:	 Spouse's Marital Status:	 Spouse's Bir
2 CONC th Year (Estimated):	 Spouse's Residence Place:	 Record Type:	 Entry Number:	 Page:	 GS Film number:	2214067 Digital Folder Number:	4434395 Image Number:	 00429
