1 NAME Johan Jacob Brehmer /Breytenbach/
2 GIVN Johan Jacob Brehmer
2 SURN Breytenbach
2 _MARNM Breytenbach
2 NICK Breitenbach
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1715
2 ADDR
3 CITY Würzburg
3 STAE Bavaria
3 CTRY Germany
1 DEAT
2 DATE BEF 29 JUL 1785
2 ADDR
3 CITY Swellendam
3 STAE WC
3 POST 6740
3 CTRY South Africa
1 OCCU Soldaat/Burger in 1746.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''See First Fifty Years Project''' http://www.e-family.co.za/ffy/g11/p11080.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Johan Jacob BREYTENBACH''' was van Wurzburg Duitsland. Hy kom in 1738 as 'n soldaat op die skip Casteel te Tilburg by die Kaap aan. Hy word 'n burger in 1746. Hy trou 3 Desember 1741 met Maria Catharina BOTHA, weduwee van Piete
2 CONC r Bezuidenhout en vorige weduwee van Coenraad Scheepers, sy was die dogter van Willem Botha en Catharina Pyl (Catharina Pyl was 'n aftammeling van die slaaf Catharina Malabar en Cornelis Claasen van Utrecht). Hy trou die tweede ke
2 CONC er op 5 Oktober 1749 met Gerbrecht BEZUIDENHOUT, dogter van Pieter Bezuidenhout en Maria Catharina Botha (deur die Bezuidenhout stam sy ook af van Catrijn van Malabar).
2 CONT
2 CONT KINDERS
2 CONT *  b1 Maria Magdalena gedoop 21 Nov 1751, X PJ Booyens 
2 CONT * b2 Jacob gedoop 21 Jan 1753, X 27 Nov 1791 Anna Maria Bester
2 CONT *  b3 Johannes Bernadrus gedoop 18 Jan 1756 
2 CONT * b4 Hendrik gedoop 9 Nov 1757, X 18 Mar 1787 Catharina Elizabeth Scheepers 
2 CONT * b5 Eva Catharina gedoop 11 Feb 1759, X A van Tonder 
2 CONT * b6 Wynand gedoop 27 Jul 1760, X 5 Mei Cornelia van Tonder, XX 27 Apr 1800 Susanna Nel, XXX 12 Feb 1804 Hermina Catharina van Wyk 
2 CONT * b7 Johannes Bernardus gedoop 5 Mei 1762 
2 CONT * b8 Johannes Melchoir gedoop 4 Mar 1764, X 3 Okt 1790 Johanna Gous, XX 8 Nov 1799 Johanna Bezuidenhout 
2 CONT * b9 Lourentius gedoop 3 Nov 1765, X 31 Jan 1790 Anna la Grange 
2 CONT * b10 Gerbrecht Eliza gedoop 31 Jan 1768, X JP van Rensburg
2 CONT *  b11 Johan Velde gedoop 18 Feb 1770 
2 CONT * b12 Anna Johanna gedoop 19 Jan 1772, X NJ van Rensburg * b13 Hester Geertruy gedoop 21 Nov 1793, X Reynier van Rensburg b14 Joseph Cornelis gedoop 16 Feb 1777
2 CONT
2 CONT Bronne: SAG Vol I Bydrae: AM van Rensburg]
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Heraldry of South African Families / Coats of arms, crests, ancestry by C.PAMA/ A. A. Balkema, 1972.
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 102
2 CONT
2 CONT BREYTENBACH
2 CONT
2 CONT Quarterly all or, 1 and 4 two circular wolf-traps in pale, 2 and 3 a z-shaped hook, all sable. Crest: a wolf sejant proper between a pair of wings or, the dexter charged with a circular wolf-trap and the sinister with a hook, as o
2 CONC n the arms, all sable. [443]
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan(n) Jacob Breytenbach, fr. Wirsberg or Würsburg. Arr. 1738, burgher 1747. Farmed in the district of Swellendam; d. 1786. Marr. 3.12.1741 Maria Botha, w.o. Pieter Bezuidenhout; remarr. 5.10.1749 Gerbrecht Bezuidenhout (14 chil
2 CONC dren).
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 335
2 CONT
2 CONT [443]: Loxton, ibid, p. 47. Arms of the barons Breidenbach zu Breidenstein (Southern Germany) but they bear the hooks azure and charged with three trefoils argent which is
2 CONT
2 CONT Page 336
2 CONT
2 CONT [443 cont.]: repeated on the sinister wing of the crest.
2 CONT
2 CONT (Bygevoeg deur Y. DROST op 10 MAART 2024)
2 CONT
