1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-C9BY-J9D4-K  Will filed 8 January 1734 Chistiaan Smit]
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-C9BB-Y9MP-5 Index Register of wills Christiaan Smit]
2 CONT
2 CONT Christiaan (Christiaan) Smith (S) or Schmidt 
2 CONT
2 CONT From Halle (Is this Germany or Belgium?) 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Germany: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halle_(Saale). [Sharon 2014] Saddler 1719-1723.
2 CONT
2 CONT Died † 1734.
2 CONT
2 CONT No valid primary  source with surname Schmidt !
2 CONT Only Smit and Smith--- then more likely from England !
2 CONT
2 CONT Why dif he never use surname Schmidt ?
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------
2 CONT DE Hoge Personalia have too many errors to rely on !!
2 CONT He never used surname Schmidt on any document !
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SCHMIDT CHRISTIAN (S). – Halle on the Saale. Saddler 1719-23. ~ Anna Botha. 5 children. + 1734. (GMR 1719-23; G.R. nr 882; Test. O.C. 4:138 and Test. CJ 1075: 5.) Cf. Friedrich Müller of Lüneburg. 
2 CONT
2 CONT - Dr. J. Hoge, Personalia of the Germans at the Cape, 1652-1806, Archives Year Book for South African History (Cape Town: Government Printer, Union of South Africa, 1946)
