2 CONT
2 CONT The parents of Christoffel Lombard
2 CONT
2 CONT I have assumed that he is the same Christoffel Lombaar, son of Johnanna Snijman, whose children are listed in the Estate Accounts drawn up after her death in May 1755. He named his first son Antonie, after his father, and the witn
2 CONC esses to the baptism were his eldest sister, Margrieta and her husband Stephanus Sebastianus Walter.
