1 OCCU Kommandant, lid Natalse volksraad, amptenaar, Z.A.R./ Commandant, member Natal volksraad, official, Transvaal Republic.
1 TITL Kmdt.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} J.C. Visagie writes the following:
2 CONT
2 CONT LOMBARD, HERMANUS STEPHANUS (b3c3d6e6) gebore tussen 1798 en 1804, Voortrekkerkommandant en Natalse Volksraadslid X (11/03/1821) Catharina Levina van Aardt (alb2c7dle6) (=19/02/1804). Woonplek: Waarskynlik Smoordrift. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Voortrekkerstamouers, 1835-1845 - Page 132
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------
2 CONT
2 CONT LOMBAARD, HERMANUS STEPHANUS //. 1842-1857 Kommandant, lid Natalse volksraad, amptenaar, Z.A.R./ Commandant, member Natal volksraad, official, Transvaal Republic.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: W. J. De Kock, Suid-Afrikaanse biografiese woordeboek
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1842, H.S. Lombard succeeded Pretorius as commandant for the town and district of Pietermaritzburg.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Standard Encyclopaedia of Southern Africa, Capetown, Volume 3
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Levina van Aardt (baptised 19 Feb 1804) d.o. Willem Adriaan van Aardt and Maria Susanna Triegard married Hermanus Stephanus Lombard in 1821.They lived at Smoordrift, Riet River East in the district of Somerset. They move
2 CONC d from there in May/June 1838 and crossed the Gariep at Buffelsvlei (now Aliwal-North) on 11.06.1838. H. S. Lombard was the leader of his trek. They settled in Natal where he played a prominent role in the society being commandant
2 CONC  and member of the Natal Volksraad.In the middle 1840s they moved to the Transvaal region of Marico/Schoonspruit where the farm Welgevonden was alotted to him on 23.08.1847
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Genealogical Institute of South Africa: SAG Vol 5
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------
