2 CONT -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 1)Baptism :  27th August, 1724. Father's name given as Hendrikse Weyer and mother Anna Lysbet Gerrits
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HY-6LWV-2H?i=473&cc=1478678&cat=993523
2 CONT
2 CONT Stellenbosch Cape Dutch Reformed Church (NGK) Records.  Image 474
2 CONT
2 CONT 2)Marriage 1 : Recorded at Stellenbosch Cape Dutch Reformed Church on 16th November, 1742 between Geele Andriesse van der Wald a quarter master in the service of the Dutch East India Company and Johanna Weijers.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:S3HT-6LX3-KSC?i=704&cc=1478678&cat=993508&personaUrl=%2Fark%3A%2F61903%2F1%3A1%3AVFTM-T24 Image 705.
2 CONT
2 CONT 3)Marriage 2: Of Christiaan Gottlieb Lessing, a soldier in the Dutch East India Company service, to Johanna Weijers widower of Geele Andriesse van der Walt and registered at Tulbagh, Cape Dutch Reformed Church on 25th September, 1
2 CONC 759.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSV8-69V1-X?i=96&cat=993682
2 CONT
2 CONT Image 97. Item 12.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4)Death: Recorded at Tulbagh Cape Dutch Reformed Church on 27th November, 1766 and being the wife of Gottlieb Lessing at that time. As Gottlieb Lessing lived and was buried at Roodezand, Tulbagh, Cape, it is assumed that Johanna d
2 CONC ied and was buried there.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSKD-F3LY?i=426&cat=993682 Image 427.
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of:  Heinrich (Hendrik) Weyers, SV/PROG and Anna Elizabeth Gerrits, b3 SM
2 CONT                         Johanna was the great grand daughter of Catharina van Malabar (via Anna Elizabeth Gerrits, b3 
2 CONT                         SM, Elsie Gerrits (Speldenberg), b1 SM, Arriantjie Van Cathrijn (Gabrielsz), SM, Catharina van 
2 CONT                         Malabar, SM/PROG ) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of:           Gaele Andriesz van der Walt (A) and Christiaan Gottlieb Lessing, SV/PROG
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of :      Andries van der Walt, a1b1; Hendrik van der Walt a1b2; Renske Olivier, a1b3; Tjaart van der Walt
2 CONT                         (B4); Johannes Petrus van der Walt, a1b5;  Anna Maria van der Walt, a1b6; Johanna Catharina 
2 CONT                         Venter, a1b7; Nicolaas (Klaas) van der Walt, a1b8; Mickael Van der Walt; Johanna Sophia 
2 CONT                          Lessing, b1; Johannes Christiaan Lessing b3; Johanna Elisabeth du Preez, b2 and Johanna 
2 CONT                          Margaretha Lessing, b4 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of:         Anna Elisabeth Weyers; Adriana Weyers, SM/PROG and Maria Weyers
2 CONT
2 CONT Half sister of: Cornelis Lekkerwijn; Adriaan Lekkerwijn; Johanna Margaretha Leckerwijn, b3c3 and Susanna 
2 CONT                          Lekkerwijn
