1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Veldkornet of the Marico district, Hermanus Philippus Potgieter 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hermanus Philippus Potgieter was a younger brother to the Voortrekker Leader Andries Hendrik Potgieter and accompanied him on the Great Trek. He was flayed alive by the Makapane (Mapela) natives of Soutpansberg District at Moorddr
2 CONC ift, 23 kilometers from Potgietersrus.
2 CONT
2 CONT I think you got it wrong. It was a Van Rensburg who was flayed alive by Makapane. Hermanus  Philippus Potgieter  was Murdered by Mapela  at Makapaanspoort.   Dries Potgieter
