1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Doop:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gebore 25 Maart 1810
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/3:1:3Q9M-CSV8-D92T-Z
2 CONT
2 CONT Alternates second name: Gertruida / Geertruy Alternates birth date: 23 or 25 March 1810
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gertruida''' and her husband the '''acting state-president of the ZAR-Tvl. Hans Grobler''' had a son named '''Willem Jacobus Grobler''' (*15.06.1827) (≈08.10.1827 Cradock) (†22.05.1891 Rustenburg) who married '''Susara Carolina
2 CONC  Snyman''' (*17.08.1824 Uitenhage) (+07.01.1891 Rustenburg) the eldest child of '''Commandant-General Theunis Snyman''' & '''Sara Jacoba Marx'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gertruida's second child with Hans Grobler was '''Hermanus Philippus Grobler''' the Dorslandtrekker and member of the Dorsland Trek Commission who participated in negotiations with the Portuguese authorities and played a pivotal r
2 CONC ole in the development of the Afrikaner-community at Humpata, Angola. Hermanus first married Jannetje Wilhelmina Elizabeth Gertruida Kruger d.o. '''Gert Stephanus Jacobus Kruger''' who was '''the uncle of President Paul Kruger'''.
2 CONC  Hermanus married secondly to '''Aletta Catharina Lourensina Philippina du Plessis'''. Aletta’s paternal aunt, '''Anna Maria Etrisia du Plessis''' (*30.04.1809), and paternal uncle, '''Jan Adriaan du Plessis''' (*02.10.1804), were
2 CONC  '''the parents-in-law of President Paul Kruger'''. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Gertruida's younger son with Hans Grobler, '''Andries Hendrik Grobler''' (*27.10.1834) (≈26.12.1834 Cradock) married '''Petronella Margaretha Potgieter''' daughter of the '''Veldkornet of the Marico district, Hermanus Philippus Po
2 CONC tgieter''' & Neeltje Elizabeth Botha. 
