2 CONT https://media.geni.com/p13/24/ac/8f/03/5344485ebc052575/baptism_records_10__original.jpg?hash=c8b7f9c512169c6bd8cab7e18044689050289e4b565ac457e563f4301ca92d01.1722581999
2 CONT
2 CONT Of Noro, on the Palmiet River 
2 CONT
2 CONT Burger Lieutenant for the 'Verre Gelegene Districten' (1743) 
2 CONT
2 CONT died circa March 1746   
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: 
2 CONT
2 CONT In January 1727 he was still listed as a ward of the Weeskamer,
2 CONT
2 CONT ie. he was still under 25 years old at that date. On 27th March 1727
2 CONT
2 CONT he is described as a minor (minderjarig) and his stepfather, Claas
2 CONT
2 CONT Jansz van Rensburg and his uncle, Willem van Staden, are looking
2 CONT
2 CONT after his affairs (MOOC 1/5, page 11).
2 CONT
2 CONT They also had a farm called the Doornekraal, on the Vette Rivier.
2 CONT
2 CONT The children are listed as given in the inventory drawn up on
2 CONT
2 CONT 3rd October 1746 after his death. Their dates of birth are from
2 CONT
2 CONT their ages as given in this inventory. 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.ballfamilyrecords.co.uk/staden/I045.html##I048
2 CONT
