2 CONT
2 CONT of Noro, on the Palmiet River
2 CONT
2 CONT Burger Lieutenant for the 'Verre Gelegene Districten' (1743)
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT In January 1727 he was still listed as a ward of the Weeskamer, ie. he was still under 25 years old at that date. On 27th March 1727 he is described as a minor (minderjarig) and his stepfather, Claas Jansz van Rensburg and his unc
2 CONC le, Willem van Staden, are looking
2 CONT
2 CONT after his affairs (MOOC 1/5, page 11).
2 CONT
