2 CONT =Prebendary of Linköping Birger Siggesson draws up his will dating, December 1352=
2 CONT
2 CONT The prebendary of Linköping Birger Siggesson draws up his will. He donates 60 land money to the cathedral in Linköping building, which Ulf Håkansson owes him; to the Archdeacon Magnus ten marvels, etc., to Leco two silver cups and
2 CONC  his better silver belt, to the sacristan Nils a silver cup, to Nils Jonsson a psalterium. Further gifts to Jonarus Esgeri, Conradus, Askeby and Vreta monastery, Nils in Stång, Johannes Puke and others.
2 CONT
2 CONT n the name of the Lord, Amen. In the Incarnation M ° ccclii on St. Lucia will Byrgerus Siggonis, prebendarius church Lyncopensis, be a severe illness, was still healthy and unharmed, and the goods to which God will write and will 
2 CONC in this manner. In the early construction of the church Lyn [c] opensis said read marks sixty pence, in which the owner Vlpho Hakunsson to do so, as in his letters about this fully contained. Also the Great archidyachono ten mardi
2 CONC linas off with one of Renault and its Sela. (1) Chief Marcho breuiarie will be better and a cup of silver. The lemons two cups of silver and silver belt is better. Ingeualdo the belt, one silver, one mortar and one of furs and ski
2 CONC ns mardilinis sleeves. Sir Nicholas Sacristan a cup of silver. Sir Nicholas Ionsson a lute. The ionarius Esgerus one pair of clothes with its furraturis. Conrad played with the silver cup with one hand and a lantern. Also any cora
2 CONC li an elder half marcham money. Campanario place only. Church of St. Lawrence place Blodsverging cured only. Campanario place the two coasts. Brothers serving III March pence piece of skin from his brother Ingemari Vrsini. Holy Sp
2 CONC irit marks the fourth house money. Church Thyrnauallum III March. I March Askaby confinement. I March vretu confinement. Also Nicholas of Stang, my dear cousin, one bowl and the silver two hooves of vulture wings, while those suma
2 CONC rios his chair and one thakhut. Stephen Stangaberg a better horn, which have wings and a belt. In the lonari Nesbyt single chair covered with a cloth. Lord Charles ...... ST. dhumos a silver spoon. Sir John Puka a spoon and a mett
2 CONC o with one of the mortar. Also Steward and my daughter four weights of red cloth, also half a piece of the heart [i] rights, X March pence a bed with all Preparamento, one red, one pot, one pot for Humulo and a basin, also sorcoci
2 CONC um is bright red, with furraturis the hood. Also servants about my daily fourteen weights white popirst. Also each of the horse, the sword and the cap iron clippeo. Items were older, single pot. Also östan servant when I had my bo
2 CONC ots and spurs. Also Harald Scrømpt a sword with a steel cap. Also, my maid Gyertrudi my white tunic. Also Sigrid my niece a front axle and a culcedram. Also linked to Margaret Neighbor mine, one cow. Then Nicholas pellipario wear 
2 CONC my blauio. Items Bagga Sudurcopie my shoes mixed color with a hood. Also Peter Vglo skin vaccines. Exequtores of this sort of testament I make honorable and that the men of the masters of the Marchis, Leçon the canons, if Ingeuald
2 CONC um prebendary and Nicholas de Stang above-mentioned stages, of which the seals together with the seal of my present need to communiri, feet, and besought, and binding it with the said exequtores, so that through me, and it was ord
2 CONC ained effectively more perfect: such and which are less properly and to do in comparison with Suppleant as they should answer before God. - https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000011875555759&photo_id=60
