2 CONC 21. ▼2 He and Eleanor de Castilla were divorced in 1229. ▼1  He married, secondly, Yolante Arpád, daughter of Andreas II Arpád, King of Hungary and Yolande de Courtney, on 8 September 1235.  He married, thirdly, Theresa Vidaure af
2 CONC ter 1251. ▼2  He died on 25 July 1276.
2 CONT      Jaime I, Rey de Aragón also went by the nick-name of Jaime 'the COnqueror' (?). ▼3 He succeeded to the title of Rey Jaime I de Aragón in 1213. ▼2
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Jaime I, Rey de Aragón and Eleanor de Castilla -1. Alfonso de Aragón, Infante de Aragón ▼2 b. c 1200, d. 1260
2 CONT
