2 CONC d broken his truce with the Kingdom of Jerusalem and was making a demonstration of his military power in front of Acre. During the demonstration, Egyptian troops hidden in the bushes ambushed a returning Frankish force which had b
2 CONC een in Galilee. James's sons, initially eager for a fight, changed their minds after this spectacle and returned home via Sicily, where Fernán Sánchez was knighted by Charles of Anjou.
2 CONT
2 CONT [edit] Patronage of art, learning, and literature Aragonese and Valencian Royalty House of Barcelona  
