2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT In a letter dated to 6 February 1288, Magnhild Hallkjellsdottir rents a part of a farm called Vik to Eirik, Abbot of Munkeliv, for five years.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Source:'' Diplomatarium Norvegicum, vol. XII, no. 10. https://www.dokpro.uio.no/cgi-bin/middelalder/diplom_vise_tekst.cgi?b=10496&s=n&str=
2 CONT
2 CONT In a letter dated to 1290, Magnhild Hallkjellsdottir rents a part of a farm called Vik to Eirik, Abbot of Munkeliv, for five years. Among the witnesses, Magnhild lists 'Lord Aslak, my in-law, and Lord William and Lady Brynhild, my
2 CONC  daughter.'
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Source:'' Diplomatarium Norvegicum, vol. XII, no. 12. https://www.dokpro.uio.no/cgi-bin/middelalder/diplom_vise_tekst.cgi?b=10498&s=n&str=
