2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Hakon Jarl den mäktige. Norsk riksföreståndare
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Haakon II Sigurdsson Jarl (Old Norse: Hákon Sigurðsson, Norwegian: Håkon Sigurdsson), (died 995) was the son of Sigurd Haakonsson, Earl of Lade, and thus Trøndelag. Haakon claimed descent from the divine linage of Sæming.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gift med Thora Skagesdotter, fire barn:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Ramveig
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Svein
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Heming 
