2 CONC and med stille veljgørenhet og andre fjormme ahndlinger. 1056 motok hun Adalabert med følge på hans annen reise i Sverige.
1 NOTE He served as King of Denmark from 1047-1074.
1 NOTE He ruled Denmark from 1047 to 1074.
1 NOTE He ruled Denmark from 1047 to 1074.
1 NOTE The life and times of the people of Sweyn II Esthrithson of Denmark was chronicled by Adam of Bremen, who was his personal friend.  Sweyn died in 1076.  The chronicles, researched up to the year 1072, was completed in 1075.  The c
2 CONC hronicles called "Gesta Hammaburgensis ecclesiae pontificum" was the chief source of information relating to the Baltic Region, and the early Norse explorations, including Eric the Red and Leif Ericsson to Greenland and Vinland.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sweyn Estridsson, son of Estrid and Jarl Ulf, quarrelled and battled Harald Hardraade over Denmark during his reign from 1047 to 1065.
