1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Maud von Bayern
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #7973, d. 16 March 1183
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Maud von Bayern was the daughter of Heinrich IX Herzog von Bayern and Wolfhildis von Sachsen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Dietbold Graf von Vohburg circa 1128. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Gebhard III Graf von Sulzbach before 1132. 
2 CONT
2 CONT She died on 16 March 1183.
2 CONT
2 CONT Forrás / Source:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.thepeerage.com/p798.htm#i7973
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/BAVARIA.htm#Mathildedied1183
2 CONT
2 CONT MATHILDE (-16 Feb or 16 Mar [1183], bur Kastl).  The Historia  Welforum names (in order) "Iuditham, Sophiam, Mahtildem, Wulfildem" as the four daughters of "Heinricus dux ex Wulfilde", specifying that Mathilde married firstly "The
2 CONC opaldo filio Theopaldi marchionis de Voheburch" and secondly "Gebehardo de Sulzbach"[366].  The Annalista Saxo names "Heinricum inclitum ducem Saxonie et Bawarie et Welfonem et quatuor filias" as children of Duke Heinrich & his wi
2 CONC fe Wulfhild, specifying that "Quarta Machtildis nomine" married firstly "Thieppoldo iuniori, filio Thieppoldi marchionis senioris" and secondly "Gebehardus filius Beringeri comitis de Sulzbach"[367].  m firstly ([1128]) DIEPOLD [I
2 CONC V] Markgraf von Vohburg, son of DIEPOLD [III] von Giengen Markgraf von Vohburg & his first wife Adelajda of Poland (-[1128]).  m secondly (contract 24 Oct 1129) GEBHARD [III] Graf von Sulzbach, son of BERENGAR [I] Graf von Sulzbac
2 CONC h & his second wife Adelheid von Wolfratshausen [Diessen] (-28 Oct [1188], bur Kastl).  
