2 CONT
2 CONT      Guelph VI von Bayern, Duca di Spoleto was born circa 1115. He was the son of Heinrich IX Herzog von Bayern and Wolfhildis von Sachsen. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on 15 December 1191.
2 CONT
2 CONT      Guelph VI von Bayern, Duca di Spoleto gained the title of Duca di Spoleto.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Guelph VI von Bayern, Duca di Spoleto and Itha von der Rhein
2 CONT
2 CONT -1. Guelph VII von Bayern d. 12 Sep 1167
