2 CONT M, #7967, d. 17 March 1126
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=10 May 2003
2 CONT
2 CONT      Conrad von Bayern was the son of Heinrich IX Herzog von Bayern and Wolfhildis von Sachsen. He died on 17 March 1126 at Bari, Italy.
2 CONT
2 CONT      He was later canonised.
2 CONT
