1 OCCU Count of Rouen,4 Duke of Normandy, Hertig av Normandie, Hertig av Normandie 966-1027, Hertig i Normand, The Good Duke of Normandy, 4th Duke Of Normandy (996- ), ALIA: The /Good/ Title: Duke Of Normandy Note: Richard ruled Normandy
