2 CONT Duke Richard II "The Good" de Normandie - also known as: The Good - was born about 0963 in Normandy, France and died on 28 Aug 1027 in Fecamp, Normandie, France . He was the son of Duke Richard I de Normandie and Gunnor de Crepon.
2 CONT
2 CONT Duke Richard married Judith de Bretagne about 1000 in Normandy, France. Judith was born in 0982, lived in Bretagne, France. She was the daughter of Duke Conan I of Bretagne and Ermangarde D'Anjou. She died on 16 Jun 1017 while liv
2 CONC ing in Normandy, France .
2 CONT
2 CONT   Then Duke Richard married Duchess Pope de Normandie about 1024 while living in Normandie, France. Duchess Pope was born about 0997 in Normandie.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Judith de Bretagne (Quick Family Chart)
2 CONT
2 CONT i. 	Duke Robert I "The Magnificent" de Normandie was born about 1003 in Normandy, France and died on 22 Jul 1035 in Nicea, Bithynia, Turkey . See #5. below.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. 	Richard III de Normandie was born about 1001 in Normandy, France and died on 6 Aug 1028 . See #6. below.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. 	Adelais de Normandie was born about 1007, lived in Normandie, France and died after 7 Jul 1037 in France .
2 CONT
2 CONT Adelais married Count Palatine Renaud I de Bourgogne before 1023 in France. Count Palatine Renaud was born about 0986, lived in Bourgogne, France. He was the son of Count Otto Guillaume de Bourgogne and Countess Ermentrude of Rhei
2 CONC ms. He died on 4 Sep 1057 .
2 CONT
2 CONT See Aldalbert family for children.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. 	Judith de Normandie was born about 1020 and died about Jul 1037 .
2 CONT
2 CONT Judith married Count Baudouin IV "Le Barbu" of Flanders. Count Baudouin was born about 0967/0968, lived in Flanders, France. He was the son of Count Arnulph II of Flanders and Princess Rosela of Italy. He died on 30 May 1036/1039 
2 CONC in Flanders, France .
2 CONT
2 CONT See Liderie family for children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children with Duchess Pope de Normandie (Quick Family Chart)
2 CONT
2 CONT v. 	Guillaume de Normandie was born about 1025, lived in Normandie, France.
2 CONT
