1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''BAUDOUIN V "le Pieux/Insulanus" Count of Flanders ([1012/13]-Lille 1 Sep 1067, bur Lille St Pierre)'''
2 CONT s/o BAUDOUIN IV "le Barbu/Pulchrae Barbae" Count of Flanders & Ogive de Luxembourg 
2 CONT x (Amiens 1028) ADELA de France, d/o ROBERT II King of France & Constance d'Arles (1009-Messines 8 Jan 1079, bur Messines, Benedictine monastery)
2 CONT 1.         BAUDOUIN VI Count of Flanders. ([1030]-Hasnon Abbey 17 Jul 1070) x  (1051) RICHILDE, wid/o HERMAN Comte de Hainaut, daughter of --- (-Messines 15 Mar 1087, bur Hanson Abbey)
2 CONT 2.         MATHILDE de Flandre ([1032]-Caen 2 Nov 1083, bur Caen, Abbey of Holy Trinity). x  (Eu, Cathedral of Notre Dame [1050/52 ]) WILLIAM I "the Conqueror" King of England.
2 CONT 3.         ROBERT I "le Frison" Count of Flanders.  ([1035]-13 Oct 1093)
2 CONT
