1 NOTE _P_CCINFO 1-20792
1 NOTE built a fleet, attracted many knights, and obtained the pope's
1 NOTE crowned King of England on Christmas of 1066. During the next few
1 NOTE years, William presided over a gradual
1 NOTE confiscation of lands, which the Norman Barons received. As a result
1 NOTE redistribution of land in England. Saxon rebellions led to the
1 NOTE blessing. He gained victory at the Battle of Hastings and was
1 NOTE of this Norman invation, the English people today are of both Norman
1 NOTE and Anglo-Saxon extraction.
1 NOTE BEGRAVEN IN GENT ST PIETERS
1 NOTE EVEN: 
2 CONT TYPE Acceded
