2 CONT
2 CONT 2.^ Throne of a Thousand Years by Jacob Truedson Demitz
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.^ Adam of Bremen (book 2, chapter 30)
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.^ Snorri Sturluson, "Heimskringla" (Olav Tryggvason's saga, chapter 113)
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.^ Thunmark-Nylén, Lena + (1981). Vikingatidens ABC, Statens historiska museum, 1981. ISBN 91-7192-490-6, p.232.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.^ Maiander, Harry + (1947). Sveriges historia genom tiderna. Första delen. Stockholm, 1947. p.159.
