2 CONT Olof Skötkonung, also known as Olaf Eiríksson[according to whom?] (c. 980–1022) was King of Sweden, son of Eric the Victorious and, according to Icelandic sources, Sigrid the Haughty. He succeeded his father in 995.
2 CONT
