2 CONT           o B12. [2m.] Andrei, Pr of Volynia (1119-35), Pr of Pereyaslav (1135-42), *11.7.1102, +22.1.1142; m.N, a granddau.of Tugor Khan of the Kumans
2 CONT                 + C1. Vladimir, Pr of Volynia (1142-49), Pr of Brest (1154-56), +28.1.1170; m.N Svyatoslavna of Chernigov (+after 1170)
2 CONT                 + C3. Yaropolk, +before 1160
