2 CONT Curphey, Robert A., Peel Castle on St. Patrick's Isle, Peel, Manx National Heritage, Man 2005 
2 CONT Krag, Claus, Aschehougs Norgeshistorie, bind 2: ?Vikingtid og rikssamling 800-1130?, Oslo 1995 
