2 CONT >>>m ([1005 or after]) --- of Scotland, [http://www.geni.com/people/Olith-possibly-Donada-MacKenneth/6000000004093135189 daughter of MALCOLM II] King of Scotland & his wife ---.  Orkneyinga Saga records that “Earl Sigurd” married 
2 CONC “the daughter of Malcolm King of Scots” (whose succession is recorded in 1005)[862].  Snorre records the marriage of "Sigurd the Thick" and "a daughter of the Scottish king Malcolm"[863].  It appears unlikely that Sigurd´s wife co
