2 CONT
2 CONT Malcolm II King Of Scotland fought a battle in 1008 at Carham withUchtred, sone of Waltheof, Earl of Northumbrians, and overcame the Danes,1017. He published a code of laws and was murdered 25 November 1034.'1004 Malcolm the son o
2 CONC f Kenneth, a most victorious king, reigned 30years through, On 1034 Malcolm King of Scots died.'
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: 'Ancestrial Roots of Sixty Colonists Who Came to New Englandbetween 1623 and 1650', 1969, Frederick Lewis Weis, p 111.
