1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 3671047. Alfreka (Afrika) Of FIFE was born about 1142 in Methil, Fifeshire, Scotland. She died before 1160. [Parents] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Afrika/Alfreka, sister of Duncan Earl of Fife.  [Burke's Peerage]
2 CONT
2 CONT He [Harald Maddadsson] m., 1stly, Alfreka, dau. of Duncan, 4th Earl of Fife (1136-1154), Regent of Scotland 1153, but repudiated her (probably after the death of her father) during Jarl Kali-Ragnvald’s absence on pilgrimage, havin
2 CONC g had issue.   [Complete Peerage, X:Appendix A:22-25]
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT I originally interpreted BP to indicate that she was sister of Duncan, 4th Earl of Fife, but the following post-em from Curt Hofemann, curt_hofemann@yahoo.com, might clear up the conflict:
2 CONT
2 CONT My records show Burke’s & CP were not at odds, but were both correct as flws:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Gillemichal, 3rd Earl of Fife, d. bef Jul 1136
2 CONT
2 CONT 11. Duncan, 4th Earl of Fife, d. 1154.  Regent for Malcolm IV “the Maiden” K of Scots until his majority 1154.
2 CONT
2 CONT 111. Duncan 5th Earl of Fife, d. 1203. Justiciar of Scotland, m. Ela (NN).
2 CONT
2 CONT 112. Afrika/Alfreka/Aufrica
2 CONT
2 CONT 3671046. Harald II Maddadson Earl Of CAITHNESS was born 1130 in Caithness-Shire, Scotland. He died 1206 in Orkney Islands, Scotland. Harald married Alfreka (Afrika) Of FIFE in 1st Wife - Repudiated After Death Of Her Father. [Pare
2 CONC nts] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Harald, Jt Jarl of Orkney with his cousin Rognvald and perhaps Jt Earl of Caithness too; born 1130; killed his cousin Harald ugni 1198 and so became sole Earl of Caithness; married 1st Afrika/Alfreka, sister of Duncan Earl of Fife
2 CONC ; married 2nd Gorm(f)la(e)th/Hvafleda/Harlod/Hvorflod, daughter of Malcolm MacHeth, 1st Earl of Ross, supposedly himself son of Angus Earl of Moray.  
2 CONT
2 CONT FamilySearch.org.PedrigreeFiles states date of Birth around 1135 (CD#126 PIN#1239096) which gives her time to have the four children born of her marriage to Harald of Orkney.
2 CONT
2 CONT Afrika (?)1
2 CONT
2 CONT F, #107696, b. before 1136
2 CONT
2 CONT Afrika (?)|b. b 1136|p10770.htm#i107696|Gillemichel MacDuff, 1st Earl of Fife|b. b 1120\nd. b Jul 1136|p882.htm#i8813||||||||||||||||
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=25 Jun 2006
2 CONT
2 CONT      Afrika (?) was born before 1136. She is the daughter of Gillemichel MacDuff, 1st Earl of Fife. She married Harold Maddadson, Jarl of Orkney, son of Madach, 1st Earl of Atholl and Margaret of Orkney.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Citations
2 CONT
2 CONT [S11] Alison Weir, Britain's Royal Family: A Complete Genealogy (London, U.K.: The Bodley Head, 1999), page 181. Hereinafter cited as Britain's Royal Family. 
2 CONT
