2 CONT
2 CONT      Gormlath MacHeth is the daughter of Malcolm MacHeth, 1st Earl of Ross.1 She married Harold Maddadson, Jarl of Orkney, son of Madach, 1st Earl of Atholl and Margaret of Orkney.1
2 CONT
2 CONT      Gormlath MacHeth was also known as Hvarflod MacHeth.1
