2 CONC iction on the date if Malcolm son of King Alexander I and Malcolm MacHeth were two different persons as suggested by Duncan[361].  m ([1130]) MALCOLM MacEth, [illegitimate son of ALEXANDER I "the Fierce" King of Scotland & his mis
