2 CONT >*2.         [https://www.geni.com/people/Dubgall-Screech-mac-Dubgaill/6000000008177334258?through=6000000005398287081 DUGALD "Screech"] .  The Saga of Eirspennill’s Hakon Hakon’s son records that "the kings of the Hebrides were D
2 CONC ugald Screech and his brother Duncan, the father of John who was king afterwards…the sons of Dungal, Somerled’s son"[1046].  Malcolm IV King of Scotland with "Uhtred filio Fergi et Gilebto fratris eius et Rad filio Dunegal et Duue
2 CONC naldo fratris eius" confirmed the donation of "terra de Dunroden" to Holyrood abbey by undated charter[1047]. 
