2 CONT ==Project MedLands==
2 CONT
2 CONT King Svend had one illegitimate daughter by Mistress (1):
2 CONT
2 CONT * 7.    '''GYDA Svendsdatter'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Snorre records the marriage of Eirik and Gyda, daughter of King Svend, in 996[199].  According to Brenner[200] Gyda was either illegitimate or the daughter of one of King Svend's marriages.  In Europäische Stammtafeln[201], she is
2 CONC  King Svend's legitimate daughter, presumably by his first marriage as she is shown as the eldest child.  
2 CONT
2 CONT m (996) EIRIK Håkonsson Jarl, son of HÅKON Sigurdsson Jarl (-in England [1023]).  Regent in Norway 1000-1015.  Jarl in Northumbria 1015. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/DENMARK.htm#GydaSvendsdMEirikHakonsson
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Finn.holbek
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Gyda Sveinsdatter (fÃ?dt ca 980 â?? dÃ?d ukjent) var datter av kong Svein Tjugeskjegg av Danmark og hans hustru Gunhild av Polen.
2 CONT
