2 CONT '''Sven Nilsson Slatte,''' to Graby in Sund parish, Östergötland county, where he initially lived. Squire. County governor in Ydre district at least 1460–1464. Then burgess in Linköping. Lived 1506.[ 26 ] '''Married 1st to Helga E
2 CONC rengislesdotter , daughter of Erengisle Gjordsson Foot and Ingrid NN Married 2nd to NN 32'''
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1. '''Elin Svensdotter ,''' lived in 1551. Married 1st in 1493 to the squire Nils Slatte , died before 1512. Married 2nd on 1515-02-04 at Graby to the squire Peder Sigvardsson , who on 1513-02-13 received a charter from Sten Stu
2 CONC re.
