2 CONT * [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/K%C3%B6nigsmarck Wikipedia – Königsmarck]
2 CONT * [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Von_K%C3%B6nigsmarck_nr_14 Adelsvapen – von Königsmarck nr * 14]
2 CONT * https://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/svenske/Stolpe/Stolpe.htm
