2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT Sjøfars sønn Brynjulf og sønnensønnen Baard Rolvsen kan være oppkalt etter henholdsvis Brynjulf Gunnarsson og Sigrid Baardsdatters far, Baard Dyresson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bård Rolfsen Rosensverd [Parents] was born about 1525. He died after 1556. He married Karen Tjøstelsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karen Tjøstelsdatter [Parents].Karen married Bård Rolfsen Rosensverd.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT M i Tjøstel Bårdsen Rosensverd M ii Mogens Bårdsen Rosensverd M iii Amund Bårdsen Rosensverd.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
