1 NAME Heidenreich VI /von Plettenberg-Platzdreck/
2 GIVN Heidenreich VI
2 _MARNM von Plettenberg-Platzdreck
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1340
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1397
1 OCCU urk. 1361-1393, 1398 dead, 1393 knight, 1378 enfeoffed with the free county of Balve, 1391 bailiff at Neuenrade, 1393 castle fief at Altena
1 TITL Ritter
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} General Notes:
2 CONT
2 CONT Gene. Plassedreck, 1346, 1395 '''Ritter''', 1378 '''Freeman Balve''', 1391 '''Amtmann Neuenrade''', 1392 '''Burglehen''' Altena, acc. Elisabeth v. Altena.
2 CONT
2 CONT Events:
2 CONT
2 CONT • Fact: Knappe, 1378.
2 CONT
2 CONT • Fact: Acquired Free County Balve, 1378, Balve, NW, DEU.
2 CONT
2 CONT • Events: Knight, 1395.
2 CONT
2 CONT Heidenreich married Elisabeth VON ALTENA. (Elisabeth VON ALTENA died after 1419.)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Heidenreich VII. Von Plettenberg (Platzdreck),'''  born around 1340 (religion: rK ), died after 1393, '''urk. 1361-1393, 1398 dead, 1393 knight, 1378 enfeoffed with the free county of Balve, 1391 bailiff at Neuenrade, 1393 cast
2 CONC le fief at Altena'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Plettenberg-Bamenohl line (expired)''':
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Plettenberg-Bamenohl line''' goes back to''' Heidenreich von Plettenberg'''. Possibly he was a son of Hunold II. In 1341 he bought the bailiwick in Plettenberg and was married to''' Elisabeth von Altena''' .''' Heidenrich i
2 CONC s also the progenitor of the Lenhausen-Stockum tribe. ''' Both''' son Heidenreich''' (* around 1402, † around 1474) was a '''squire and heir of the Finnentrop castle complex''', today Altfinnentrop. Around 1433 he married the heir
2 CONC ess Angela von Heyen (Heygen) and thus came into joint ownership of the Bamenohl house . In 1447 he was able to expand his holdings at Bamenohl. Bamenohl later came into the possession of the Plettenberg-Heeren line (see above).
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
