1 CONC depri ve Orm Of thetitle he had already given him"), Hakon was g iven Orm's titleand authority, and married Ragnild.
1 CONT
1 CONT ----------------------------------
1 CONT
1 CONT According to Burke's Peerage, Hakon was ggs on his grandmother's side Of Hakon I "The Great", a Jarl.
