0 @N6000000000269709264@ NOTE Ancestral File Number:<AFN> b6c4
0 @N6000000001634087740@ NOTE <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
1 CONT           "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
1 CONT <html  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en"><head>
1 CONT <title></title>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8"/>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="Content-Style-Type" content="text/css"/>
1 CONT </head>
1 CONT <body>
1 CONT <div><font face="Verdana" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt">Gedoop op 4 April 1705 in Paarl/Drakenstein, Wes-Kaap. Sy likwidasie en distrubisie rekening 
1 CONT word eers geliasseer op 5 Desember 1789. Hy is 'n heemraadslid vir Swellendam. Hy woon 
1 CONT op die plaas Grootvadersbosch, distrik Heidelberg, Wes Kaap. Die plaas word huidig Goede 
1 CONT Hoop genoem. Trou met Isabella POTGIETER op 9 Mar 1727 in Paarl/Drakenstein, Wes-Kaap.</span></font></div>
1 CONT <div><br /></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt">KAB MOOC 13/1/16.34</span></font></div>
1 CONT <div><br /></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"></div>
1 CONT </body>
1 CONT </html>
0 @N6000000001634093215@ NOTE <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
1 CONT           "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
1 CONT <html  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en"><head>
1 CONT <title></title>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8"/>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="Content-Style-Type" content="text/css"/>
1 CONT </head>
1 CONT <body>
1 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt">1789. (KAB MOOC 13/1/16.34) Hy is getroud in Kaapstad op 16 Oktober 1774 met Aletta 
1 CONT Elizabeth Bezuidenhout, 29/10/1747. Sy is die dogter van Cornelis Bezuidenhout en Cornelia 
1 CONT Botha</span></font></div>
1 CONT </body>
1 CONT </html>
0 @N6000000000269770411@ NOTE Ancestral File Number:<AFN> b6c4d1
0 @N6000000001634087719@ NOTE <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
1 CONT           "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
1 CONT <html  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en"><head>
1 CONT <title></title>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8"/>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="Content-Style-Type" content="text/css"/>
1 CONT </head>
1 CONT <body>
1 CONT <div><font face="Verdana" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt">Gedoop op Junie 1731.</span></font><font face="Verdana" color="#0000ff" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt"><sup> </sup></span></font><font face="Verdana" size="1"><s
1 CONC pan style="font-size:9pt">Hulle gemeenskaplike testament word opgestel en onderteken 
1 CONT ongeveer halftwaalf in die voorm&#244;re. Sy ouers is reeds oorlede en sy benoem haar ouers die 
1 CONT Heemraad Philip du Preez en Juffrouw Isabella Potgieter as haar erfgename indien hulle sou 
1 CONT sterf sonder kinders. She signed a will on 5 Feb 1768 in Kaapstad, Wes-Kaap. (KAB CJ 
1 CONT 1668.52) Sy en haar tweede man Christof Frederik Wotki stel hul gemeenskaplike testament 
1 CONT op terwyl hulle woon in Swellendam, Christof is bode van Swellendam op die stadium. Sy is 
1 CONT getroud in Paarl op 21 Augustus 1749 met Johann Christian Vogel, * c 1719 + 18/12/1765. 
1 CONT Johann Christian Vogel is afkomstig van Brunswyk. Hy arriveer in 1739 aan die Kaap en doen 
1 CONT aanvanlik diens as 'n soldaat. Hy word later bevorder tot die rang van korporaal. Hy word 'n 
1 CONT vryburger in 1746. Hy tree as bode van Swellendam op vanaf 1752. Sy trou 'n tweede keer 
1 CONT op 28 Februarie 1768 met Christoffel Frederik Wotzky, * c 1730. Hy is afkomtig van 
1 CONT Cammelwitz, Silesi&#235;. Sy trou 'n derde keer op 18 Desember 1791 Christiaan Albrecht Kraft, + 
1 CONT 1816 Swellendam. Christiaan Albrecht Kraft is afkomstig van Flensburg, Holstein, Duitsland. 
1 CONT Hy is aanvanklik 'n soldaat in diens van die VOC. Hy word later 'n ystersmid in Swellendam 
1 CONT van 1779 tot 1784. Hy wou terugkeer na Duitsland in 1785, maar hy word beroof van sy geld 
1 CONT vir sy pasaat. Die landdros van Swellendam neem hom daarna in diens. Hy word 'n vryburger 
1 CONT van Swellendam in 1791. Hulle is geskei en hy is toe getroud met Maria Isabella Steyn</span></font></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br /></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt">She signed a will on 26 Jan 1757 in Swellendam, Wes- Kaap. (KAB MOOC 7/1/16.57)</span></font></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"></div>
1 CONT </body>
1 CONT </html>
