0 @N6000000006275269334@ NOTE Frederik Potgieter; he was baptised at Swellendam, Cape, 11 June 1724, died at Stellenbosch, Cape, September 1785, son of Johannes (Jan Harmenzs) Potgieter (see 256) and Maria Catharina Van Eeden (see 257).
1 CONT He married (2) 7 April 1765 Maria Magdalena Landman.
1 CONT From this marriage:                             Willem Hans Jurgen Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Maria Catharina Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Jan Frederik Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Catahrina Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Maria Magdalena Jacoba Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Beatrix Johanna Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Frederik Johannes Abraham Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Theunis Jacobus Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Catharina Potgieter   
1 CONT                      Frederica Potgieter   
1 CONT He married (1) at Swellendam, Cape, 2 June 1748 
