1 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt">He was christened on 9 Oct 1729 in Paarl/Drakenstein, Wes-Kaap.</span></font><a href="http://pottassjj.com/pottas/fowsrc.htm" l "5208"><font face
1 CONC ="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt"><u><sup>(5208)</sup></u></span></font></a><font 
1 CONT face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt"><sup> </sup></span></font><a href="http://pottassjj.com/pottas/fowsrc.htm" l "1417"><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt"><u><sup>(1417)</su
1 CONC p></u></span></font></a><font face="Times New Roman" size="3"><span style="font-size:11pt"> He died before 
1 CONT 5 Dec 
1 CONT 1789. (KAB MOOC 13/1/16.34) Hy is getroud in Paarl op 21 Augustus 1749 met Maria 
1 CONT Porgieter, = 02/12/1731+ c 1766. Sy is die dogter van Hans Jurgen Potgieter en Cornelia Botha. 
1 CONT Hulle is kleinneef en kleinniggie. Hy is 'n tweede keer getroud op 7 September 1766 met Susanna 
1 CONT Strydom, = 27/04/1745. Sy is die dogter van Petrus Strydom en Rachel Roux. Hy is 'n derde keer 
1 CONT getroud in Kaapstad op 18 Junie 1775 met Maria Bezuidenhout. Hy is 'n vryburger van 
1 CONT Swellendam</span></font></div>
