0 @N6000000002319313696@ NOTE Born: ABT 1031
1 CONT      Some say died 1098. Slew Macbeth 1057. King of Strathclyde.
1 CONT ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
1 CONT Malcolm III, Caennmor of Scotland, King of Scotland (born 1031). He
1 CONT married Ingibiorg
1 CONT   Finnsdottir in 1066 and they were the parents of: Duncan II of
1 CONT Scotland, King of
1 CONT  Scotland (born 1060); Malcolm; and Donald.
1 CONT
1 CONT In 1068, Malcolm III married Margaret  Atheling, the Exile at
1 CONT Dunfermline Abbey in Fife, Scotland. They were the parents of:
1 CONT           Edward; Edmund I of Scotland, King of Scotland; Ethelred,
1 CONT Abbot of Dunkeld; Edgar of  Scotland, Kinf of Scotland (born 1074);
1 CONT Alexander I the Fierce of Scotland, King of  Scotland (born 1078);
1 CONT Matilda (Edith) of Scotland (born 1079/80); David I the Saint of
1 CONT Scotland, King of Scotland (born 1084); and Mary of Scotland. Malcolm
1 CONT acceded the    throne on April 25, 1058 at Scone Abbey in Perthshire.
1 CONT He died on November 13, 1093  at Alnwick Castle and was interred at
1 CONT Escorial in Madrid, Spain.
