1 CONT   26. ^ Orkneyinga Saga, c. 109. Oram, David I, pp. 101–102 identifies Hvarflod as daughter of Máel Coluim mac Alaxandair however; MacDonald, Outlaws, p. 99, from whom the date is taken, makes Hvarflod the daughter of Máel Coluim 
1 CONC MacHeth.
1 CONT   27. ^ MacDonald, Outlaws, p. 158.
