0 @N6000000000234128279@ NOTE He was not married to Catharina Hoffmann vdK, a slave. Sh e had a child Christened on 21 August, 1729 and named him L ourens Erasmus and gave Lourens Erasmus as the father.  Burger Drakenstein
0 @N6000000000234224279@ NOTE He was not married to Catharina Hoffmann vdK, a slave. Sh e had a child Christened on 21 August, 1729 and named him L ourens Erasmus and gave Lourens Erasmus as the father.  Burger Drakenstein
0 @N6000000000234273584@ NOTE He was not married to Catharina Hoffmann vdK, a slave. Sh e had a child Christened on 21 August, 1729 and named him L ourens Erasmus and gave Lourens Erasmus as the father.  Burger Drakenstein
0 @N6000000000269709226@ NOTE Ancestral File Number:<AFN> b3
1 CONT
1 CONT Lourens Pieter /Erasmus/ Burger van Drakenstein, plaasboer o.a. by sy skoonma Louisa Cordier op "Wildebeestkuil" of "Geelblomsvlei" (vandag Suider Paarl) asook op sy eie leningsplase "Uitkomst" vandag distrik Ceres naby Karoopoort
1 CONC , Agter Bokkeveld en "Beerenfontein", Roggeveld bo-op Kamsberg, vandag distrik Sutherland suid van die dorp; beide destyds distrik Drakenstein.
1 CONT
1 CONT Uit sy huwelik  met Martha Pienaar is 14  kinders  gebore  was waarvan 12  manlik  was, wat lei tot 'n vermenigvuldigde nageslag. Hy het volgens SAG ook 'n voorkind by Catharina Hoffman gehad, vermoedelik 'n slavin.
1 CONT
1 CONT FreeFormatDate:Moontlik eerder1  DEAT 2  PLAC Cape, South Africa 2  QUAY 0
