0 @N6000000004027483138@ NOTE One record only lists husband as "Pierre Jourdan" (and as father of Helena Catherina)
0 @N6000000000234143488@ NOTE Born 1672. From Saint-Martin de la Brasque, Provence, arriv ed probably in 1688 on the "Berg China". 18.10.1694 owner o f "La Motte", Franshoek. In 1709 he bought "Morgenster" nea r Somerset West, one of four parts of "Welgelegen"
1 CONC , the est ate ofAdriaan van der Stel. In 1719 he sold "La Motte".
0 @N6000000000234241488@ NOTE Born 1672. From Saint-Martin de la Brasque, Provence, arriv ed probably in 1688 on the "Berg China". 18.10.1694 owner o f "La Motte", Franshoek. In 1709 he bought "Morgenster" nea r Somerset West, one of four parts of "Welgelegen"
1 CONC , the est ate ofAdriaan van der Stel. In 1719 he sold "La Motte".
0 @N6000000000234294793@ NOTE Born 1672. From Saint-Martin de la Brasque, Provence, arriv ed probably in 1688 on the "Berg China". 18.10.1694 owner o f "La Motte", Franshoek. In 1709 he bought "Morgenster" nea r Somerset West, one of four parts of "Welgelegen"
1 CONC , the est ate ofAdriaan van der Stel. In 1719 he sold "La Motte".
0 @N6000000001634141363@ NOTE <!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
1 CONT           "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
1 CONT <html  xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en"><head>
1 CONT <title></title>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html;charset=utf-8"/>
1 CONT <meta http-equiv="Content-Style-Type" content="text/css"/>
1 CONT </head>
1 CONT <body>
1 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt">Stamvader.</span></font></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT <font face="Verdana" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt"><b>Jacques MALAN</b>, gebore 1665, was 'n Franse Hugenoot van Saint-Martin-de-la-Brasque, 
1 CONT wat in 1688 op die skip <i>Berg China</i> in SA aangekom het. In 1699 is hy getroud met<b> 
1 CONT Elizabeth (Isabeau) le LONG</b>, weduwee van Jean Jourdan. Hy het eers in Hottentots 
1 CONT Holland gewoon, en was lid van die kollege van landdros en heemrade van Stellenbosch.</span></font></div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><br />
1 CONT </div>
1 CONT <div align="left"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><span style="font-size:9pt">Toe Elizabeth in oorlede is in 1736, het hulle die plaas <i>De Faisante Kraal</i> aan die Bot rivier 
1 CONT en 'n ander in Hottentots Holland besit. Hy het ook vanaf 1694 die bekende plaas <i>Bo-La 
1 CONT Motte</i> in Franschoek besit, wat sy eiendom geword het in 1714 en hy weer verkoop het in 
1 CONT 1719, as ook <i>Languedoc</i>,<i> Rhone</i> (1702) en <i>Morgenster </i>(1711) in Somerset-wes, een van 
1 CONT die 4 gedeeltes van Adriaan van der Stel se plaas Wegelegen. Hy is oorlede omstreeks 
1 CONT 1742 en het 7 kinders gehad.</span></font></div>
1 CONT </body>
1 CONT </html>
0 @N6000000004027486001@ NOTE Malen?
1 CONT b c1650  	St. Martin-De-La-Brasque, Vaucluse, France
1 CONT b c1652?
1 CONT b About 1675  	Merindol, Vaucluse, France
1 CONT b c1645?? - probably 7 mistaken as 4
1 CONT b c1672 Merindol, La Motta, Aigues, France
