0 @N6000000002248119218@ NOTE Judith founded abbey of Bernay, Normandy, ca 1026.
1 CONT
1 CONT Judith married Richard II, Duke of Normandy, son of Richard "The Fearless" I, Duke of Normandy and Gunnora de Crepon. (Richard II, Duke of Normandy was born about 958 in Normandy, France and died on 28 Aug 1026.)
