1 CONT !DUKE OF NORMANDYSource: Church of JC of the LDS "Ancestral File" CD-Rom database, ver 4.17.[Brøderbund WFT Vol. 2, Ed. 1, Tree #1241, Date of Import: May 8, 1997]
