0 @N6000000007329706321@ NOTE The Saxon & Norman Kings, by Christopher Brooke] (1027-1055).  [] Robert
1 CONT 'The Magnificent', sometimes Robert 'The Devil'.  Terry McCarty, fidonet
1 CONT July 25 '95] Robert 6th Duke of Normandy   from  1027  until his death
1 CONT 1035, in Bithynia. His wife was Herleve of Falaise,   aka  Arlette. She
1 CONT died ca 1050.
