1 CONT Bernard  S. Bachrach, State-building in Medieval France: studies in early
1 CONT Angevin  history..essays.. ] :Robert I 'the Devil' of Normandy Duke
1 CONT (Circa 999   - 2 Jul  1035)...
1 CONT Duke of Normandy [Ref: Weis AR #121]  //  [Tom Cain 10-29-95, <tcain -at-
1 CONT easynet.co.uk>] ..the accepted   ducal  family  name was Fitzrollo, not
1 CONT d'Courcy. They trace descent from Rollo or   Hrolf  'Gangr' (the Tall or
1 CONT 'Longstrides') who received the ducy from the   Frankish  king Charles
1 CONT the Simple in 911. Roots  of   Sixty Colonists, 6th Edition, Baltimore:
1 CONT Genealogical Publishing Co,  1988.
