0 @N6000000002187757693@ NOTE Wulfnoth Cild
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia.
1 CONT Jump to: navigation, search
1 CONT Wulfnoth Cild Thegn of Sussex was the father of Earl Godwin and the grandfather of King Harold II of England. Wulfnoth was himself a descendant of King Ethelred I of Wessex, through his youngest son Aethelhelm and by virtue of tha
1 CONC t a prince of the royal blood, as were his descendants including Harold Godwinson (Harold II).
