1 CONT daughter of
1 CONT      Skogul-Tosti (born about 909). Sigrid had been married to Eric VI
1 CONT Bjornsson the Victorious,      King of Sweden and they had been the
1 CONT parents of Olaf Skootkonung of Sweden, King of      Sweden and Holmfrid
1 CONT Ericsdottir. Sigrid has also been associated with Vissavald of Kiev.
