1 CONT     MALCOLM II, son of KENNETH II, was King of Strathclyde, 990-995; King of Scotland, 1005-1034; fought in battle in 1008 at Corham with Uchtred, son of Waltheof, Earl of Northumberland; overcame the
1 CONT     danes in 1017; published a code of laws - Royalty for
