1 CONT King of Strathclyde 990 - 995, King of Strathclyde 997 - 1005, King of Scots 1005 - 1034. Conquered Lothian 1018. King of Alba, King of Strathclyde. Ssaid to have married an Irishwoman from Ossory. Killed by his kinsman. Source: R
