1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT King of Scots, 25 Mar 1005 - 1034 Fought a battle at Carham with Uchtred (d.1016), son of Waltheof, Earl of the Northumbrians, and overcame the Danes, 1017 Published a code of laws Was murdered 25 Nov 1034 "1004. Malcolm the son o
1 CONC f Kenneth, a most victorious king, reigned 30 years. 
