0 @N6000000002187814219@ NOTE Henry IV of Limburg
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Henry IV (1195–25 February 1247) was the duke of Limburg and count of Berg from 1226 to his death. He was the son of Waleran III, count of Luxembourg and duke of Limburg, and Cunigunda, daughter of Frederick I, Duke of Lorraine.
1 CONT
1 CONT Originally lord of Montjoie, he married the heiress of the county of Berg, a daughter of the count Adolph III, who died at the Siege of Damietta in 1218. Ermengard and Henry could not immediately inherit the county, as it was held
1 CONC  by Engelbert I, Archbishop of Cologne. Engelbert being the principal adviser of Frederick II, Holy Roman Emperor, he was confirmed in the county for life, paying a rent to Henry and Ermengard.
1 CONT
1 CONT Engelbert was assassinated on November 7, 1225 and Henry inherited Berg, inheriting Limburg a little while later. He then entrusted Montjoie to his brother Waleran, who already held Fauquemont. He then fought the count of Isambert
1 CONC , his brother-in-law, who was suspected of the assassination of Engelbert. In 1228, took part in the Sixth Crusade to the Holy Land. Upon returning to Germany, he made war on the archbishop of Cologne, Konrad von Hochstaden betwee
1 CONC n 1238 and 1241.. He was counted among the partisans of the Hohenstaufen.
1 CONT
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Waleran III Duke of Limburg
1 CONT 1226–1247 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Waleran IV 
1 CONT Preceded by:
1 CONT Engelbert II Count of Berg
1 CONT 1225–1247 Succeeded by:
1 CONT Adolph IV 
0 @N6000000000269792324@ NOTE Ancestral File Number:<AFN> progenitor
1 CONT
1 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Michael MULLER kom by die Kaap aan in 1735 as 'n soldaat van Meerkerk, Keulen, Duitsland. Hy was eers 'n kneg vir A Bergh van 1740 tot 1745. Hy word 'n vryburger in 1745. Hy woon op Zeekoeigat, Swellendam. Hy trou 4 Mei
1 CONC  1746 met Adriana VAN ROOYEN. Sy was gedoop 28 September 1721 en was die dogter van Cornelis van Rooyen en Jacomina van Deventer.
1 CONT
1 CONT BIOGRAPHY: KINDERS b1 Hillegard gebore 9 Maart 1747, gedoop 1 Jun 1747, X Petronella Fourie b2 Cornelius Johannes gedoop 10 Sep 1748, X 18 Maart 1770 Susanna Elizabeth Ferreira, XX 8 Nov 1801 Engela Geertruida Meyer weduwee van Co
1 CONC rnelis van Rooyen b3 Jacomina Aletta gedoop 8 Nov 1750, X 3 Maart 1765 Stephanus Ferreira b4 Margaretha Alberta gedoop 10 Okt 1752, X 5 Nov 1769 Jan Abraham Meyer b5 Sara Elizabeth gedoop 12 Jan 1755, X 23 Feb 1772 Salomon Ferreir
1 CONC a b6 Elisabeth Sophia gedoop 25 Des 1756, X 20 Feb 1774 Johannes Frederik van Rensburg b7 Maria Catharina gedoop 19 Sep 1758, X 23 Okt 1775 Christoffel Botha, XX 2 Nov 1806 Johannes Wilhelmus van Eyck b8 Martha Johanna gedoop 25 D
1 CONC es 1760, X 23 Jan 1780 Petrus Hendrik Ferreira b9 Hester Angenessa gedoop 3 Jul 1762, X 25 Okt 1778 Andries Johannes Holthausen b10 Josina Adriana gedoop 6 Okt 1764 b11 Michael Arnoldus gedoop 8 Nov 1767, X 11 Maart 1787 Rosina El
1 CONC izabeth Rautenbach
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Hy sterwe 19 Julie 1768. Sy sterwe 1789.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT BIOGRAPHY: Bronne: Heese en Lombard
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT ALTBIRTH: Herkoms soms gegee as Kuilsland, Holland
1 CONT
1 CONT AKA: Michael Muller
