1 CONT b4 Margaretha Alberta gedoop 10 Okt 1752, X 5 Nov 1769 Jan Abraham Meyer<br />
1 CONT b5 Sara Elizabeth gedoop 12 Jan 1755, X 23 Feb 1772 Salomon Ferreira<br />
1 CONT b6 Elisabeth Sophia gedoop 25 Des 1756, X 20 Feb 1774 Johannes Frederik van Rensburg<br />
1 CONT b7 Maria Catharina gedoop 19 Sep 1758, X 23 Okt 1775 Christoffel Botha, XX 2 Nov 1806 
1 CONT Johannes Wilhelmus van Eyck<br />
1 CONT b8 Martha Johanna gedoop 25 Des 1760, X 23 Jan 1780 Petrus Hendrik Ferreira<br />
1 CONT b9 Hester Angenessa gedoop 3 Jul 1762, X 25 Okt 1778 Andries Johannes Holthausen<br />
1 CONT b10 Josina Adriana gedoop 6 Okt 1764<br />
1 CONT b11 Michael Arnoldus gedoop 8 Nov 1767, X 11 Maart 1787 Rosina Elizabeth Rautenbach</span></font></p>
1 CONT <p><font size="2"><span style="font-size:10pt">Hy sterwe 19 Julie 1768. Sy sterwe 1789.</span></font></p>
